<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Yohaannisixxaa Wengeele</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohaannisi Borreesseexxa Gootta No'oke Yessuusi Kirstoosixxaa Wongeele</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohaannisixxaa Wengeele</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaannisi Borreesseexxa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Gootta No'oke Yessuusi Kirstoosixxaa Wengeele</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaannisixxi wengeele Yessuusii'i shiqissaak maala oddo'weexxi manjiinxe oddo'n afemeeke hedhoke Mageniinke hiyyichcho kadeexxa ifisatiten; kunni maxxafii ifike uminni ifiseeshshanni tinni wengeele borreessendeechchi konnee maxaafa haassessaak manni Yessuusi anjiralloke kadee dagaan hiyyemeemmake Mageniinke Belto kadeexxa amannaashshanna iso'ni amana insa'nexxenaa'n kexxeexxa insa'ne duuchchi woddixxa hedho alfinaaxxa konkaashshaten (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tennee wengeelexxi siretixxi kuta iikki duuchchi woddiki Mageniinki hiyyichchinna Yessuusii mitte kandeexxa e'yichchiinxe bifanni shiqqiseechchi uduma Yessuusi anjiralloke kadeexxi dagaan hiyyemeemmake Mageniink Belto kada isixxa leellishshaaxxa gargar gargar hexxeexxa masuwwa leellishaan; ookkonneechchi uduma tennee masuwwanaa'n maa gumma afendeexxa barrisaaxxi jirtuwwa hordoffeexxi daggaan; tinni kutanna haasottaachchi mitti mitti manni Yessuusi'n amaneexxi isixxe hordoffeeyye kada insa'nexxa, welikinna iittanni hitta isoo xa'neexxanna iso'n amanabe'no hineeshaten; hafuura adhdha (13-17) Yessuusi abidemeexxa hashsha ifixxe ergameeyyenni welti isi hittee qico duudhendeexxa mittumma afeemmaxxanna isixxe fannisenshaxxe shiqo'n qixxeefachchotikanna dayyeefachchottika hiyyichcho insa'ne'n laqiseemmaxxa haaso'aan. Iitti muuxamiinxa hafuura adhdhaari Yesuusixxe abidenshaxxeenna murteete shiqa isixxee iittanni isixxe fanniseshaxxeenna reyotenaa'n isixxee ke'axxee iittanni reyotenaa'n ke'eechchi uduma ifixxe ergameeyye'n leelleexxa qalli assaakeeran.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaannis Yessuusi Kiristoosi darre'n afendaaxxa eettenee duuchchi woddixxa hedho lumiseexxi leellishaak kunni badhaadhi ta'inaa'n safeexxi Yessuusii'i oriinsha, dhugaatishsha, hedhotishshanna asseexxi adhdhaakeeri'aten. Yohaannisixxa wengeele gargar hexxeexxe assaachchi amanatixxa dhugaara ifisatee ege'nedeexxanna barra barrake galduma'n la'oonfantaaneexxa tinniirinna wodi'iinsha, buddeeniisha, ifaa, alallisanjo, gedhebo, woyinetika hiddichchonna woyinetixxa gumma fakkattaaxxa yaanuwwa mammaasik la'oonfata isexxen.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichchoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqqallo Yohaannisiinna Yessuusixxa edisaaxxa ergameeyye <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ergatensha safa Yessuusixxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerussaalem giddonna iseke qarqara'n isixxe ergatenshaxxa muuxamiinxa barruwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Reyotenaa'n ke'a Gootiinxanna isixxa leella <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxamaa: Gaaliila giddo wele wodda ifixxe ergameeyye'n leelleexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Hedhotika Hiyyichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Sirende'ni hiyyichchi hedhemman. Hiyyichchi iikkinna Magenik welti hedhemman; iikki hiyyichchinna Magenokemman. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Isi sirende'ni Magenik welti hedhemman. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Duuchchiinxi yaane isi darree'n dadende; dademeechcho duuchchanaa'n isi belo dademeechchi mittichchinna hedheemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Iso'ni hedho hexxemman; iitti hedhonna manjiinke ifamman. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Iikki ifinna dukkanate'n ifaan. Dukkanatinna ifa ookkone injifattebaan.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Magenbaa'ni ergemeeki Yohaannisi hiyyemaak mitti manjichchi hedhemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat. 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luq. 3:1-2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Manji duuchchi isi darree'n amanaashsha ifakee isi dhugaa kulaake kade dage. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Isi ifakee dhugaa kulo'a dage malee: isi umo ifike'ni ifakemabaan. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Manji duuchchi'a ifa uwwaak dhugaatik ifi butta duuchchi'a dagaamman. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Kunn ifi butta duuchcha'ni hedhemman; butta duuchchanna dadendeeki isinnitemmani yaane kinn butta duuchcha konne ifa egendeemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ifike kadekeribaa dagen: firi isikinna kinni isoo adhdhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kaddo malee adhdheekeeri'anna summa isike'ni amaneeke duuchchi'a kinni Mageniinxe oose kaddandaashsha baallooma insa'ne'aa uwween. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Insa'nenna Mageni darree'n ilemmee malee manjiinxe sannenni yookaan maaliinxe fedhiinn yookaan labbakixxe fedhiinni ilemmebaan.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Iikki hiyyichchinna maalake kadeexxi no'oxxe oddo'ni gale. No'onna badhaadhikinna dhugaati wo'meexxi anna ifikibaa'ni dageeke ookkone Mitteelchi Beltika ulfinna uundennen. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohaannisinna: « ‹Ani udumi'ni daga'neek ani'a ediseenni hedhemmaxxee isi hara anee sa'eeken› hiyyennexxi dhugaa isixxee kuleennak konneten» hiyye'e hafuura gikki asseexxi isixxee dhugaa kule. <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />No'o duuchchiing isixxe wo'muntenaa'ni badhaadhange'n badhaadha adhdhinennen. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Seeri Muuse ga'mii'ni uwweme: badhaadhikinna dhugaa kinni Yessuusi Kiristoosi darre'ni dagge. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ijenda Mageno uudek mittikinna hedhebaan: yaane kinn Mageni Aabinni welti hedheek iikki Mitteelcho isike Belto kadeek Mageni isi ifise.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqammake Yohanisixxa Dhugaa Kula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luq. 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ayihudiink baalloomiink manni, «Ati ayyete» hite Yohanisii qortaashsha Iyyerusaaleminaa'ni qeesetanna Leewwito ergee wodda, Yohaannisi dhugaa kula konneechchinn butti'a hexxeexxen: <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohaannisi hiissexxi, «Ani Kiristoositebaan» hiyyee dhugaa kulee malee waakkatebaan. <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Insa'nenna, «Atita ayyete? Eelyaasiteeta?» hine isoo qorre. Isinna, «Waawwo'o» hiyye. Insa'nenna isoo, «Atita ookkone dagaani hiyyemaammake wabeekichchoo?» hine. Isinna, «Waawwoti» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:15">Lew. 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Insa'nenna muuxamake'ni, «Atita ayyete? No'o ergeke manna'n hiissichcho kullannoshsha ati, atike umixxee maa hitaatte?» hine.<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohaannisinna wabeekichchi Issayaasi haaso'eemmashshann, « ‹Goottiinka ora toggi asse!› hiyya'ni qiilla gammoojje'ni raarammake manjichchiki hafuuri anteni» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ergemeemmaki manninna Feerisitotixxe gamonaa'nitemman: <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Tennexxee, «Ati Kiristoosite yookaan Eelyaasite yookaan wabeekake kada gophphottole mayeeta xammaqatee?» hine isoo qorre. <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohaannisinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiissee qici, «Ani wodi'iki xammaqaannen: ha'noo egendinebaaki kinni ha'nooxxe oddo'n uure'een. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Isi ani udumii'ni daga'neeken; ani isixxe kopheka usurra midde tika dande'abe'noken» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Tinni duuchcha kaddeeki Yohaannisi xammaqammake Yordanoosike wode'i wido Biitaaniya hiyyemaake loola'nitemman.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mageniinka Gedhechcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Yohaannisi langa baro Yessuusi isibaa daga'naa uudeexxi, «Yoona buttatike mannixxa cubbo fugussaaki Mageniink gedhechchi konneten!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />«Iikki ani udumii'n dagaaki ani'a ediseenni hedheeke kademmaxxee isi anee sa'aan» hiyyeennaki isoten. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />«Ani umo anigee isoo ege'neennabaan; yaane kinn ani wodi'iki xammaqa'n dageennechchi isi Isira'eelike arda'ni ege'nemmaashshaten» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yohaannisi hiyyeexxi dhugaa kulee qici, «Woyyichchi Hafuur guugenjotishsha iimatenaa'n butti'a dirreexxi isi hana ofo'laa'na uudennen. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Aninna isoo ege'neenabaan; yaane kinni wodi'iik xammaqannoshhsa anee ergeek ‹Woyyichchi Hafuuri dirreexxi iso'n ofo'leenaa uuddaatek iikki Woyyichchi Hafuurinni xammaqaak isoten› hiyye ane'n kule. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Aninna uudennen, isi Mageniinke Belto kadeexxa dhugaa kulaannen.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edisse Ye'endeexxa Yessuusixxa Hordofeeyye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Higgeenni langaxxa barra Yohaannisi leme ifixxe hordofeeyyenni welti ookkone booncho'ni uurreemman. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yohaannisi Yessuusii'i ookko'ni sa'aa'naa uudeexxi, «Kunse Mageniinka gedhechchi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Lame Yohaannisixxi hordofeeyye Yohaannisi tennee haaso'aa'naa laqqeexxi Yessuusii hordoffe. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yessuusinna isoo hordonfa'naa udumi'a wirri hiyye uudeexxi «Maa hassina'ne?» hiyye isa'nee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Insa'nenna, «Rebbi, ati haba hexxaatte?» hine. «Rebbi» hiyya «Barachchiissalloo» hiyyaten. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Isinna insa'nee, «Daggineexxi uudde!» hiyye. Tennexxee insa'ne marreexxi isi haba hedha'neexxa uunde. Insa'nenna eettene barra isinni welti honse. Yannatinna barrixxe tomme saatebaattemman. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yohaannisi haaso'eexxa laqqeexxi Yessuusii'i hordofeexxe lame hordofeeyyenaa'ni mitti Simi'ooni Pheexiroosike dayyo Indiryaasitemman. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Indiryaasi sirete'n dayyo ifika Simi'oonii haseexxi, «Mesihii alfineenna!» hiyye iso'n kule. Mesihi hiyya (Kiristoosi yookaan hariiremeeke hiyyaten.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ookkoneechchi udima Indiryaasi Simi'oonii'i Yessuusibaa iyyedage. Yessuusinna isoo uudeexxi, «Ati Yoonake belto Simooniten; ati Keefa hiyyendee ye'endatton» hiyye. (Keefa hiyya Pheexiroosi yookaan rassa) hiyyaten.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filiphosiinna Natina'eelii'i Yessuusi Ye'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Langa baro Yessuusi Geliila'a me'a hase; Filiphphoosiinna afeexxi isoo, «Anee hordofi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filiphphoosi Indiryaasishshanna Pheexiroosishsha Beete Sayidake qachchike manjomman. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filiphphoosi Naatina'eelii'i afeexxi iso'n, «Muuse seeriinke maxaafa'n, wabeekotinna isixxee maxaafake'n borreessiteeka Yooseefika belto Naazireetika Yessuusi alfineennen» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Naatina'eelinna hiisseexxi, «Naazireeti'ni eloxxi yaane hara afema dandeetta?» isoo hiyye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:46">Filiphphoosinna, «Daggetexxi uudi!» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yessuusinna Naatina'eeli isibaa daga'naa uudeexxi isixxee isoo, «Kunni xaqaro afebaake dhugaatike Isira'eelike manjon» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Naatina'eelinna Yessuusii'i, «Hitta anee egendette?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yessuusinna «Filiphphoosi atee ye'ebaa edi darre ode'iinke haqichchi hunda hexxe'naa atee uudennen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Naatina'eelinna, «Rebbi ati Mageniinke Belton; Ati Isira'eelike moyanjon» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yessuusinna isoo, «Amandeettechchi ode'iinke haqichchi hunda atee uudennen hiyyennexxeete? Ati edi'a tennee saxxaaxxa yaanuwwa uuddatton» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Lebeexxi, «Dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen iima bandee'naa Mageniinxi erganna Manjiinke Belti hana iimi'ni butti'a dirrita'naanna iimi'a me'ita'naa uuddinaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Dada. 28:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Wode'e Woyinetixxe Bookabaa Jijjiire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Sakkaxxa barra Geliilake boga'n Qaana hiyyemaake qachcha'n aadha heerumiinxe jila hexxemman; Yessuusixxi amanna ookko hexxemman. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yessuusinna isixxi hordofeeyye eettene aadha heerumiinxe jilabaa ye'emmeemman. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Woyinetixxi booka muddee wodda Yessuusixxi ama Yessuusii'i, «Woyinetixxi booka insa'nenaa'n muddeeqqa» hite. <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yessuusinna isee, «Tee manjichcho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">No'oxxe hiyya'ni amayyoo hinnanashshaten. </char></note> maa anee assi hitaateta? Yanna anxi ta'i qico gelte'ebaan» hiyye <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ama isixxinna ookkoo ergatemaammakaara «Isi ha'noo'ni hiyyaaxxa duuchcha asse» hite.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ayihudiink anshedhatik seeri ajajjammashshanni jaani kinjik hujemeek waabuwwi ookkoo hedhemman; mitti mitting waabi lame yookaan sase oddowwa wode'e abida dande'aakemman. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yessuusi ookkoo ergatammake manna «Lumolla waabuwwa'ni wode'e wonshe!» hiyye. Insa'nenna lumolla waabuwwa afo'i qico'ni wode'e wonshine. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ookkonneechchi uduma isi insa'nee: «Hanii'ni ikkildine ita itisammake murrichchi'a uwwe» hiyye. Insa'nenna isi ajajemmashshanni assine. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Itatiki murrichchinna woyinetixxe bookabaa jijjiiremeeka wode'e suuxe: kaddo malee isi tinni woyinetixxi booka habaa'n dageexxa ege'nebaan: ookonne wode'e ikkilemmak erganjuwwi kinni egenneemman. Ookkonneechchi uduma isi waajubichcho qofitinni ye'eexxi: <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />«Manji duuchchi edise shiqisaaxxi eloxxe woyinetixxe bookan: keesummatinna heddo ha'witeechchi uduma goofa woyinetixxa booka shaqisaan: ati kinn eloxxa woyinetixxa booka ta'i qico'n tursiteetten.»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yessuusi konnee mambe'iinke beessisuwwinaa'n ediseeka Geliilake boga'n Qaanake qachcha'ni asse: ulfinna isikanna ifise: hordofeeyye isixxinna iso'ni amande. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ookkonneechchi uduma isi ama ifixxenni, dayyuwwi ifikinninna hordofeeyye ifixxenni welti Qifirnahoomike qachchibaa me'e. Insa'nenna ookkoo heenooxxa barra ofolle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat. 4:13</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Woyyichcha Galma Ca'a asse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat. 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar. 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luq. 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ayihudiink sa'atik ayyaan shiqeeshshanni: Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemi'a me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Fula. 12:1-27</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Woyyichchi Galmixxe baxxe'ni lalo, gedhebokanna guugeenna gurgurammaka manna iittanni ofo'leexxi maalaqa jijjiidhdha'neeka manna ookkoo hedhe'naa afe. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Tennexxee isi wodarotixxa halange giisseexxi gedhebokanna lalo duuchcha Woyyichchi Galmixxe baxxenaa'ni fulche: isinna jijjiidhdhammake mannika maallaqa xeere: beeruwwa insa'nekanna gonbise. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Isinna guugeenjo gurgurammaka manna, «Konneera ookko'ni fulchee! Anke Annika mine dadda'latike mine assitinoqqe'e!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Hordofeeyye isixxi, «Atike mini'a afennexxi eloxxi hinaafe anee giiratishsha gubbeen» hiyyende borreessendeexxa kassi hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Far. 69:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ookkonneechchi uduma baallooma afeemak Ayihudiink manni Yessuusii'i, «Ati tennee duuchcha assatee dande'a affeettexxa kokeessaaka maa mambe'a beessisa no'o'ni leelishshatto?» hine. <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Konnee Woyyichcha Galma diige! Aninna sase barra giddo iso hiissee uurrisannon» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat. 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar. 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Tennexxee Ayihudi isoo, «Konnee Woyyichcha Galma ijaaratee shoole tommenna jaane wogga bireen; hittata ati sase barra giddo isoo hiissite uurrissatto?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Yessuusi kinni Woyyichcha Galma hiyye haaso'a wodda ifike bisixxeetemman. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Tennexxee isi reyotenaa'n ke'eechchi uduma isixxi hordofeeyye isi maa haaso'eexxa kassi hiteexxi Woyyichcha maxaafuwa'ninna Yessuusi haaso'eke hiyyichcho'n amande.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yessuusi sa'atike ayyaana'n Iyyerusaalemi hedhemma wodda heddi manni isi hujemmaka beessisuwwa uudeexxi iso'ni amane. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Yessuusi kinn manjo duuchcha ege'nemmaxxee insa'nee amanaammabaan. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Isi manjiinke godobi giddo hexxeexxa duuchcha ege'nammaxxee mittikinna manjiinxee iso'n dhugaa kula hasissaammabaan.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusiinna Niqodimoosii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Feerisitoti giddii'n Ayihudiinke sooreessuwwinaa'n Niqodimoosi hiyyemaak mitti manjichchi hedhemman. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Isinna hashsha Yessuusibaa dageexxi, «Ee, barachchiisalloo Mageni isinn welti hedheeka manjo malee ati assitetteka mambe'iinka beessisuwwa fedheek assa dande'ammabaaxxee ati Magenibaa'n daggetteke barachchiisallo kaddetexxa egenneennen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Higgeenni Yessuusinna, «Ani dhugaate ati'a hiyyaannen; fedheeki manji langaxxa ilemoole malee Mageniinxa mootumma uuda dande'abaan» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Niqodimoosinna, «Manji cimeechchi uduma hitta ilema dande'a? Isi langaxxa ilemo'a higgeenni amatike godoba'ni higa dande'a?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yessuusinna hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Dhugaate ate'n hiyyaannen fedheek manji wode'ikinna Hafuuriki ilema gophoole Mageniinxa mootumma e'ya dande'abaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Maalakenaa'n ilemeek isi maalaken; Hafuurakenaa'n ilemeek hafuuraken. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ani, ‹Ha'no langaxxa ilema hassissaan› iitta hiyyeennexxee ati mambe'a hitoxxe'e. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Diidallo eettebaa diidalleessitaan luuljo isekanna laqqatton. Yaane kinn diidallo habaa'n daggaaxxa, habaa me'itaaxxa egendebexxon. Hafuurakenaa'ninna ilemeek duuchchi iitanden.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Niqodimoosinna, «Tinni hitta kada dandeeta?» hiyye iso qore. <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yessuusinna Niqodimoosi'n, «Ati Isira'eelike barachchiisanjo kaddeenni hexxe'e tennee yaanuwwa egendebexxoo?» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Aninna dhugaate ate'n hiyyaanneni no'o egennennexxe haasonnannon; uundenexxanna dhugaa kullannoni; ha'no kinn dhugaa kula no'oxxa adhdhitinebaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ani buttatixxa yaane ha'no'n kulee'naa amandinebaaki manni iimatixxa yaane ha'no'n kulennele hittata amandina? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Iimatenaa'ni dirreeka Manjiinka Belto malee iimi'a me'eek ayyinna hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Muuse bago baga'n bofa fannisemmashsha Manjiink Beltinna iittanni fannisema hassissaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Lak. 21:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Tinninna iso'ni amanaaki duuchchi, duuchchi woddixxa hedho alfaashshaten.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />«Iitanni iso'ni amanaaki duuchchi, duuchchi woddixxa hedho afaashshate malee ba'abaashsha Mageni mitte Belto ifika sa'isse uwwaa qico'ni butta duuchcha hara eeyyeen. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Mageni Belto ifika kaba butta duuchcha'ni ergeechchi kaba buttike manna'ni muro'aate kaddebaak butta duuchcha isi darree'n anjiro'aaten. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Iso'ni amanaake duuchcha'ni murte murendabaan; iso'n amanabaak kinn mitte Mageniinke Beltike summa'n amana gophemmaxxee qaranni iso'ni murende'een. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Murtetinna tenneten: iikki ifi kaba butta duuchcha'ni dageeni; manni kinni huje insa'nexxi elobaaxxe kaddemmaxxee ifiin irra dukkana eeyye. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Elobaaxa yaane assaaki duuchchi ifa jibbaan; huje isixxinna farri hite leellitabaashsha isi ifiinbaa dagabaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Dhugaa assaak kinn huje isixxi Mageniinxe fedhiinni hujendeexxe kaddeexxa farri hite leellitaashsha isi ifiinbaa dagaan.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqalli Yohaannisi Yessuusixxee Dhugaa Kuleexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusinna hordofeeyye isixxi Yihudake bogibaa me'ine: isinna ookkoo xammaqa'ni insa'nenni welti shiixxooxxa yanna ture. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Eettene yanna Yohaannisinna, Saalemi bira Heenoon hiyyemaake booncho'ni heddi wode'i hedheemmaxxee isi manna xammaqa'neemman; mannikinna ookkoo xammaqematee dagaa'neemman. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Tinninna kaddeek Yohaannisi usuremebaa edi ga'mamman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luq. 3:19-20</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Tennexxe mitte mitte Yohaannisixxi hordofeeyyexxenna Ayihudiinxe oddo'n anshedhatike galdumixxee moronsha kexxe. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Insa'nenna Yohaannisibaa dangeexxi iso'n, «Barsiisanjo Yordanoosi wido atinni welti hedhemmak; atinna isixxee dhugaa kuldeettak manjichchi kunse xammaqa'neen; manji duuchchinna isibaa me'a'neeni» hine. <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohaannisinna hiyye hiissee qici, «Iimi'ni isi'aa uwwendeexxe kaddoole malee fedheek manji mitteechchonna alfa dande'abaan. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />‹Ani Kiristoositebaan; yaane kinni isi edo ergemeennen› hiyyennashshaanni ha'noo umo ha'noogenninni dhugaa kuldinaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh. 1:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Waajubichcho, waajubichchiinxen; hafuura isika laqatee isi bira uurraki jaali kinni waajubichchiinka hafuura laqaa wodda isi yo'osha gammadaan. Iikki gammadi anken; isinna ta'a kunni muuxxemeen. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yohaannisi lebeexxi, Isi lummedhdha ani kinn shiixxedhdha hasissaan.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Iimi'ni dagaak isi duuchchiinga caaleeken: buttatike kadeeki buttatingen; isinna buttatinxe haaso'aan. Iimi'ni dagaak duuchchingenaa'ni caaleeken; <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />isi uudeexxanna laqeexxa dhugaa kulaan; yaane kinni dhugaa kula isixxa adhdhaak hedhebaan; <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />isixxa dhugaa kula adhdhaak iikki manji, Mageni dhugaatike kadeexxa kokeesse. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Mageni Hafuura ifika laakkossi belo uwwaammaxxee iikki Mageni ergeeki Mageniinka hiyyichcho haaso'aan. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Mageni Aabi Belto ifika eeyyaan; duuchchiinxa yaane anga isixxe'ni uwwe'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luq. 10:22</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ookkone Belto'ni amanaak duuchchi, duuchchi woddixxe hedho afe'een, ookkone Belto'ni amanabaak kinn Mageniinxi mufe iso'ni hexxaa malee'e hedho alfabaan.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Mitte Samariyichcho Manjichchonni Welti Haaso'eexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Feerisito Yohaannisi caala Yessuusi heddo manna hordofeeyye asseexxanna xammaqeexxa laqqe; <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />kaddo malee xammaqeek Yessuusite kadebaak isixxe hordofeeyyemman. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Goottikinna tennee ege'ne'e Yihudaka boga waaleexxi Geliila'a hige me'e. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Semaariya giddii'n sa'a isoo hassisse'eemman.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Tennexxee isi Semaariya giddo Ya'iqoobi belto ifike Yooseefi'a uwweeke bogi bira hedheeke Siikaar hiyyemaake qachchibaa dage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Dada. 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ookkonna Ya'iqoobixxi wode'iinxi bale hexxemman. Yessuusinna oriinxe me'anni gopheemmaxxee eettene wode'iinxe bale bira ofo'le; iitti yannanna barrixxe jaane saatebaatemman.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ookkone wodda mitti Semaariyichcho manjichcho wode'e ikkilto'a daggee wodda Yessuusi isee, «Konne wode'inaa'ni ha'wonaa ani'a uwwi» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Eettene yanna'n hordofeeyye isixxi itatichcho hirto'a qachchi'a me'iteemman. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Tinni Semaarichcho manjichcho Yessuusii'i, «Ati Ayihudichchoke kaddee hitta anee Samariyichcho wode'e anee ha'wisi hitatto?» hite; isenna tennee hiteechchi Ayihuudoti Samaritoti mittooma afa gophammaxxeeten.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yookaan Samarito la'oofatteexxa qore yookaan miya la'oonfantaammabaan</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Izr. 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:12">Neh. 4:12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yessuusinna ise'n, «Mageniinxa uwwa egendeettelenna wode'e ani'a ha'wisi hiyyeeki ayyete kadeexxa sila egendeettele atinni isoo kadhattattan isinna hedhotika wode'e ati'a uwwamman» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Manjichotinna iso'n hitee qici, «Anke Gootta ati ikki'littattochcho affeebexxon: baletinna yo'oshsha qeerraaxxe kaddemmaxxee konne hedhotika wode'eta habaa'n affatto? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Dhugaandinni ati tennee wode'iinxa bale no'aa uwweeke anna no'oke Ya'iqoobinaa'n saxxatto? Isinna isixxi oose, hori isikinna tennee balenaa'ninni ha'wineen.» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yessuusinna ise'n hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'ee qici, «Konne wode'enaa'n ha'waak duuchchi higgeenni dheebo'waan; <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ani uwwannoke wode'enaa'ni ha'waak kinni haranga dheebo'wabaan; ani isi'a uwwannok wode'i isi giddo duuchchi woddixxa hedho phu'issaaxxe wode'iinxe muumme kadaan.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Manjichotinna isoo, «Anke Goottaa ani dheebo'wabe'noshshanna wode'e ikki'lonaa kaba dagabe'noshsha maganne konnee wode'e ani'a uwwi!» hite.<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yessuusi ise'n, «Marte aro'o atika yexxe kabaa higi!» hiyye kule. <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Manjichchotinna, «Ani aro'o afebe'non» hite hiisite haasote. Yessuusinna ise'n hiyyee qici, «Aro'o afebe'non hiyya atixxi dhugaanden; <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />dhugaaten ati onde aro'o affe'eettan; ta'a atinn welti hedheekinna atike aro'o kada gophemmaxxee tinni haasottetexxi dhugaaten.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Manjichchotinna hite hiissite iso'n haasotee qici, «Anke Goottaa ati wabeekichchoke kaddeetexxa ta'a ege'nenne. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Annuwwi no'ok tennee kooba hana sagandeen; ha'no Ayihuudi kinni manji sagada hassissaaki Iyyerusaalemike qachcha'niten hitinaan.»<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yessuusinna ise'n hiyyee qici, «Tee manjichcho tenne kooba'ninna kaddo Iyyerusaalemi'ni Aabi'a sagadinaaxxi yanna daggaaxxa anee amani. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ha'noo Samarto egedinebaakee sagaddinaan; no'o kinn anjirema Ayihudakenaa'nite kaddeexxa egeneennaxxee sagandaanen. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Dhugaati sagadaakiiri Aabi'a, hafuurikinna dhugaati sagadaaxxe yanna daggaan; ta'anni dagge'een; Aabinna iittanni isoo dhugaati sagadaakaara eeyyaan. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mageni Hafuuraken, isoo sagadaakiirinna Hafuurikinna dhugaati isoo sagada hassissaan.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Manjichchotinna, «Kiristoosi hiyyemeek Mesihi dagaaxxa ani ege'nennen; isi dagaa wodda duuchchiinxa yaane no'n kulaan» hite. <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yessuusinna ise'n, «Ateenni haaso'aannengiqa Ani isoten» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ookkone wodda hordofeeye isixxi higge dagge. Insa'nenna isi meyyaxxenni welti haaso'aa'naa uunde mambe'a hine; yaane kinn, «Ati maachcho hassaatte?» yookaan, «Ati isenni welti mayee haasottaatte?» hiyye isoo qoreeki mittikinna hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma manjichchotinna odolcho ookkonni waaldeexxi qachchi giddi'a ille iima higgeexxi ardake'n, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Assennexxa duuchcha ane'ni kuleeka manjichcho amme uudde! Akimagaada isi Kiristoosite kaduu?» hite. <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Insa'nenna qachchi giddii'ni fulleexxi isi hedhebaa marre. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Eettene yanna hordofeeyye isixxi isoo, «Barachchiisanjoo, sagale iti» hite kadhate.<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Yaane kinn Yessuusi insa'ne'n, «Ha'no egendinebaaxxa ani itannoxxe ita afeennen» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hordofeeyye isixxi weli'aan weli, «Dedha manji isi'a itaachcho iyyedagu'uu?» hite.<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Anxi ita anee ergemmakixxa fedhii assatenna huje isixxa muuxaten. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ha'no, ‹Shoole agenji uduma haamatixxi maye geltaan› hitina'nebaata? Kunse Ani ha'no'n haamatixxi maye gelteexxa qokki hitine ookkonee fichcha uudde! Hiyyanneen. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Iikki haamaki ta'atenna kaddoole midde runda adha'neen; duuchchi woddixxe hedho'a kaddaaxxa gumma bukki assaan; tennexxee iikki rokaakinna haamaak mittenba gammandaan. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Tennexxee ‹Mitti rokaan; weli kinn haamaan› hiyyemeemmak iikki mammaasi dhugaaten. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Aninna ha'noo elootinebaaxxa haandino'a ha'noo ergeennen; weli eloositaaxxa huje huje; ha'noo kinn insa'ne eloonneemmaxxa gumma bukki assitine.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Heddo Samaarto Amande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Manjichchotinna, «Isi ani assennexxa duuchcha ane'n kule» hiteexxi dhugaa kuldemmaxxee, ookkone qachchanaa'n heddo Semaariyak manni Yessuusi'ni amane. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Tennexxee Semaariyak manni isibaa dagee wodda isi insa'nenni welti turaashsha jabeessine isoo kadhante: isi ookkoonna lame barra ture. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Isike hiyyichchonaa'ninna kexxeexxa weli heddi manni iso'ni amane. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Insa'nenna manjichchote'n, «Ta'a no'o iso'n amannaannechchi ati no'o'ni kuldeetexxe calli'aatebaan; no'o umi no'ongenninni isi hiyyeexxa lanqeennen. Kunni manjichchi dhugaaten butta duuchchike anjirallo kadeexa no'o egeneennen» hine.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Baallomeemmake Manjichika Belto Fayyise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Lame barra uduma isi Geliila'a me'e. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yessuusi ifinge uminninni «Wabeek ifike boga'ni ulfeessemabaan» hiyye haaso'eemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat. 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luq. 4:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Yaane kinni isi Geliila geyeeshanni Geliilak manni gammashshoti isoo qophedhe; tinninna kaddeechchi insa'ne sa'atike ayyaana'ni Iyyerusaalemi he'nemmaxxeenna isi ookkoo asseexxa duuchcha uundemmaxxeeten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoh. 2:23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yessuusi wode'e woyintixxe booka assemabaa Geliilake boga'ni hedheeke Qaanake qachchibaa langaxxa dage. Eettene yanna Qifirnahoomi giddo belti isik elagopheek mitti mootummatike minik ja'laabi hedheemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yoh. 2:1-11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Kunni manjichinna Yessuusi Yihudake boginaa'n Geliila'a dageexxa laqee wodda, isi Yessuussibaa mareexxi reyo shiqeeka ifika belto dageexxi fayyisaashsha isoo kadhate. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yessuusinna iso'n, «Haanonna ha'no beessisuwwakanna mambe'uwwa yaane uuddinebaak amandinabaan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Iikki ja'laabi manjichchinna iso'n «Anke Goottaa anki belti reyebaang magaanneten ani'a dhaqqabi» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yessuusinna, «Belti atik hedhoti hedhaani kexxe missi» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Manjichchikinna Yessuusi haaso'eeka hiyyichcho amaneexxi me'e; <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />isinna orange'ni hedhee'naa erganjuwwi isiki isinn afemmeexxi, belti isik lubbondinni hedheexxa iso'ni kule. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Manjichchikinna belti ifik heene yanna'ni fowwi hiyyeexxa insa'nee qoree wodda iso'n, «Eebbinji isoo wocci asseeki bereqe torbaane saate'niten» hine. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Beltiink anninna iitti sa'aate Yessuussii, «Belti atik hedhoti hedhaan» hiyyexxe yanna kaddeexxa kassi hiyye. Tennexxee isinna isik mini hadi duuchchi Yessuusi'n amanne. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Kunninna Yessuusi Yihudake boganaa'n Geliila'a dageexxi hujeeke langake mambe'iinke beesisan.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuuusi Edike Sanbatixxa Barra Mitte Naafa Manjichcho Fayyiseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Ayihudiinke ayyaan hedhemman: Yessuusinna Iyyerusaalemi'a me'e. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Iyyerusaalemii'n Gedhebiinxe hula bira ondi iimi'ni kapheemeki mammaremaaka oruwwa afe'eeki Aramayike laagadinni Beetesayida hiyyemaaki mitti xammanqaak baleessi hedhemman. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Konne oruwwi giddo heddi elagopheek, naafuwwi, ille ba'ekiir, shiilekiir, gogeekiir, ookkone wode'iixxa lele'ma heqqe'na'ni ookkoo diinphaamman. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Mitte mitte yanna iimixxi erganna dirriteexxi ookkone wode'e lele'misaa wodda edise ookkone xammanqammake wode'i giddi'a e'yeeki bisoke'ni galdeexxe heene dhibonaa'ni fayya'nemman.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Konne laakosik borresemk yaadi wele hundaayetixxe borro'ni hedhekeban. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ookkonna sase tommenna saddeeta wogga ela gophe hedhemmak mitti manjichchi hedhemman. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yessuusinna konne manjichcho ookkoo diiphe'naa afeexxi kunni manjichchi heddo yanna konne qicinn hedhemmaxxa ege'neexxi, «Ati fayyitotaa hassaatte?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />«Anke Gootta,» Iikki ela gopheemmaki manjichchinna hiissexxi, «wode'i lele'ma wodda xammanqaamak wode'i giddo anee uggaaka manjo afebo'non. Ani ookkoo e'yonaa wo'laananno wodda weli anee edisa'neeni» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yessuusinna isoo «Kexxe rare atixxa dulkitetexxi me'i!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Manjichchikinna hirba okkone'n fayye: isinna rare dulkeexxi me'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Tinn yaane kaddeeki edike sanbatixxe barramman. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Tennexxe Ayihudiink baalloomiik manni ookkonee fayyemmaka manjichcho, «Telchi edi sanbata kadeemmaxxee rare atixxa dulkatee seeri ati'a uwwabaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh. 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Erm. 17:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Isi kinn «Anee fayyiseek manjichchi, ‹Rare atixxa dulkitettexxi ane me'i!› hiyyeen» hiyyeexxi insa'ne'a hiisse.<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Insa'neena isoo, «Atee ‹Rare atixxa dulkite me'i!› hiyyeek isi ayyete?» hine qorre.<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Yessuusi insa'nenaa'ni bayyate ardiinxe oddo'ni sa'emmaxxee iikki manjichchi ayyi isoo fayyiseexxa ege'nemmabaan.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi ookkone manjichcho Woyyichcha Galmi giddo afeexxi isoo, «Ta'a ati fayyiteetten: tennenaa'n caaldexxi ate'ni geltabaashsha konneechchinn edi'a cubbo hujjoxxee!» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Manjichchikinna isoo fayyiseek Yessuusite kadeexxa mare Ayihudiinke baalloomiinke manna'n kule.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Belti Hedho Uwwaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ayihudiink ja'laabbuwwi Edike Sanbaatixxa barra Yessuusi tenne yaanuwwa asseemmaxxee isoo abido'aa shorraamman. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Anni Anki telchi qico'ni hujende'ni hedheen: Aninna iittanni huja'ennen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Yoona Ayihudiink ja'laabbuwwi, Yessuusi'i edika sanbata ulfeessa gopheexxee calla kaddebaak isi Mageno Anna ifike assedheexxi ifi Magenik qixxe assemmaxxee insa'ne isoo shinno'a jaba qicinni hansa'nemman. <verse eid="JHN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'a hiyye hiissee qici: «Ani dhugaate ha'no'aa hiyyaannen, Aabi hujaa'naa uudexxa calla malee'e Belti umi isikinni mitteelchonna assa dande'abaan. Aabi huja'nexxa duuchcha Beltikinna hujaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Aabi Beltokanna eeyyaammaxxee huja'neexxa duuchcha isi'a leellishaan. Ha'noonna konne mambe'a hitinaashsha isi tenne saxxeexxa yaane isi'a leelishan. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Aabi reyemmaka manna ke'issaammashsha hedhotanna insa'ne'aa uwwaammashshanni Beltikinna kinni iittanni eeyyeke duuchchi'a hedho uwwaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Aabi mitteke'ninna murte murabaan: yaane kinni murte duuchcha muraashsha Beltokee sa'issee uwween: <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Isinna tennee assechchi, manni duuchchi Aabii ulfeessammashshanni Beltokanna ulfeesaashshaten. Belto ulfessabaak ergeemmaka Aabiinna ulfeessabaan.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Ani dhugaate ha'no'aa hiyyaannen, hiyyichcho anka laqaaki, anee ergeke'ninna amanaaki duuchchi woddixxe hedho afeen: isi reyotiba'ni hedhotiba'a foofemmaxxee iso'ni murendabaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ani dhugaate dhugaate ha'no'aa hiyyaannen, reyemmak manni Mageniinke Beltika hafuura laqqaaxxe yanna daggaan: isenna ta'aten: laqaakiirinna hedhot hedhaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Anni umo ifinge'ni hedho afemmashshanni, Beltikinna umo ifinge'ni hedho afaashsha isi'a uwwe'en: <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Isinna Manjiinke Belto kadeemmaxxee isi murashsha baalloomma isi'a uwwedheen.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />«Tenne yaane'ni mee mambe'a hiyye! Moogemeek duuchchi hafuura isika lanqaaxxe yanna daggaan; <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />eloxxa hujeekiir reyotenaa'n ke'eexxi hedhaan elobaaxxa hujeekiir kinni reyotenaa'n ke'eexxi murte adhdhaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxee Kulendeexxa Dhugaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />«Ani calli umo ankenni mitteelchonna huja dande'abo'non, Ani muraannoki Ani laqenexxe callan, Anee ergeekixxa eetti malee ifixxe eeyyanni assa gophaannaxxee Ani muraannoxxi murte dhugaatixxen.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Ani anke umixxee dhugaa kulonnole, dhugaa kula anxi adhdhendabaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Anxee dhugaa kulaak weli hedheen; isi anxee dhugaa kulaaxxi dhugaatixxe dhuga kula kaddeexxa ege'neennen.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />«Ha'noo Yohaannisibaa erganjo ergitine'eemmani isinna dhugaatixxee dhugaa kule'een. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ani tennee hiyya anxi ha'noo anjirendino'ate malee ani'a manjiinxi dhugaa kula hasiisseexxetebaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohaannisi buba'ni ifa uwwammake ifishshatemman; ha'noonna heenooxxe yanna'a isike ifinni gammadino'a eettineen.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />«Ani kinn Yohaannisi kuleexxe dhugaa kulaannaa'ni saxxeexxa dhugaa kula afeennen; tinni anxi dhugaa kula Aabi hujannoshsha uwweexxe hujen. Tinni ani hujaannexxi huje Aabi anee ergeexxa dhugaa kuldaaxxen. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Anee ergeek Aabi isi umo isingenninni anxee dhugaa kule'een. Ha'noo ijje isika hafuura laqqinebaan; bifa isixxanna uuddineebaan, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />isi ergeeke'ni ha'noo amana gophphinaammaxxee hiyyichchi isik ha'noo'ni hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ha'noo Woyyichcha maxaafuwwanaa'n duuchchi woddixxa hedho alfitinaachcho labbaa'naa; maxaafuwwa qottinaan. Kunni maxaafuwwi anxee dhugaa kulaakeeran, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />kaddo malee ha'noo hedho alfitinaasha anibaa daga hassinabaan.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />«Ani manjokenaa'n ulfinna hasabo'non. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Yaane kinn ani ha'noo ege'neennen; Mageniinxi jaalalanna qalbe ha'nooxxe'ni hexxebaaxxa ege'neennen. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ani anke Annike summinni dage'naa anee adhdhitinebaan; yaane kinn weli ifike summinn dageele adhhditinaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Ha'noo weli'aan weli ulfeessitina'neek, yaane kinni mitte Magenonaa'ni daga'neeka ulfinna halsa gophphina'noole yoona hittata amana dandeettinaa?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />«Ani ha'noo Aabi edo ku'lannochcho ha'no'n fakkaatoqqe'e: ha'noo ku'laaki adde assexxinemange Muuseten. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ha'noo sila Muusee amandineele ane'ninna amandinamman; yaane kinn isi anxee borreesseen. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Yaane kinn ha'noo isi borreesseexxa amana gophphinoole ani haaso'annexxa hitta amandinataa?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Onde Kuma Manna Itise</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luq. 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi Xibiryadoosi hiyyendaaxxe Galiilixxe lumoxxe abbaayya wido foofe. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Heddi manninna Yessuussi ela gopheeka manna fayyissa'ni assemmaka mambe'iinka beessisuwwa uudemmaxxee isoo hordofe.<verse eid="JHN 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi kooba qabateexxi hordofeeyye isixxenni welti ookko ofo'le. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ayihudiink sa'atik ayyaani shiqeemman. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ookkone wodda Yessuusi ardi isibaa dagaa'naa toggi hiyye uudeexxi Filiphphoosii'i, «Kunni manni so'iinxa kebbonna habaa'ni hirranno?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Isinna tenne qorechi isoo hega uudo'ate malee isi umo ifikenni asso'a hedeexxa ege'neemman. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filiphoosinna iso'n, «Mitti mitting manji so'iinxa kebbonnaa'ni shiixxo shiixxoxxa itaasha assatee lame dhibba diinareke so'iinxi kebbo midde geltabaan» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Hordofeeye isixxi giddii'ni mitti Simi'ooni Pheexiroosik dayyi Indiryaasi hiyyee qici, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Onde shiixxaramma so'iinxa kebbonna lame shiixarama qulxu'me abideeki belti mitti kaba hedheen; yaane kinn kunni konne ardi duuchchi'a habaa'ni geya?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yessuusinna insa'nee, «Ardi ofo'laasha asse!» hiyye. Ookkone booncho'ni yo'oxxi bada'a hexxemman; ookkoo onde kuma geyaaki labballi ofo'le. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yessuusinna onde so'iinxa kebbo aadheexxi galateeffate; ofo'leeke manni'anna insa'ne hansaa qicika qoode; iitanni qulxu'metanna hansaa qicixxa uwwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Duuchchiingi manni ite goddeechchi uduma isinna hordofeeyye ifixxa, «Mittikinna xeeremebaang indaa'naa gatemmachcho bukki asse!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Insa'nenna manni iteexxe onde so'iinxe kebbonaa'n gatteexxa hanba bukki assineexxi tommenna lame qore wonshine. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa manni Yessuusi assammaka mambe'iinka beessisa uundeechchi uduma, «Dugaaten, kunni kaba butta duuchchibaa dagaake wabeekichchan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yessuusinna manni dageexxi isoo hunnadinni moyanjoke asso'a hedeexxa ege'neexxi higgeenni qofinni koobatibaa bayyate me'e.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Abbaayyate'n Hana Tarkaafata'ni Me'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat. 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Bogi hashsha wodda hordofeeyye isixxi abbaayyatibaa addaadde me'ite: <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />insa'nenna hobolote'ni gulufeexxi Qifirnahoomik qachchibaa me'ine. Bogiki hashsheemman Yessuusinna insa'nebaa ta'i qico'n dageemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Jabaxxi diidallo diidallesitammaxxee abbaayya lele'mite. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Hordofeye isixxinna onde yookin jaane kiilomeetire qico hobolo shaffisa'n me'iteeshshanni Yessuusi wodii hana tarkaafata'n hobolotibaa daga'naa uudeexxi alalte. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Isi kinn insa'ne'n, «Anteni mee sodaatte!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Tennexxee insa'ne hobolote'n isi gulufo'a hanse; hobolotinna iikki woddi insa'ne me'inammake boonchiba gelte.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Langa baro abbaayyati widi darre gatemmak mann ookko mitte hobolo calli hexxeemmaxxa egenne; insa'nenna Yessuusi hobolo gulufebaaxxanna hordofeeyye isixxi qofitinn me'iteexxa egenne. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ookkoneechchi uduma wele hoboluwwa Xibiryadoosinaa'n kexxeexxi ardi Gootti eebbiseemmaka onde buddeena itemmabaa dagge. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Yessuusi yookaan hordofeeye isixxi ookko he'nebaaxxa manni ege'nee wodda, Yessuusika hasito hoboluwwa eettennenni Qifirnahoomi'a me'e.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Hedhotike Budeenan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Manni abbaayyati wido isoo afee wodda, «Barchchiisanjo haano kaba daggette?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yessuusinna insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen anee hassina'neechchi budeena ittinemmaxxeenna godditinemmaxxeete malee, mambe'iinka beessisuwwa uuddinexxeetebaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Baxxaaxxe ita hujjinoqqe'e; tenne irra Mageni Aabi Belto ifike'ni kokeessatika maxxansa maxxansemmaxxee Manjiinki Belti ha'noo'a uwwa'neexxe duuchchi woddixxe hedho'a kaddaaxxe ita'a hujje.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma mannikinna isoo, «Yoona Mageniinxa huje hunjonaa no'o maa assa hasissa?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Ha'no isi erge'eeke'ni amandinaashsha tinni Mageniinxe hujen» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Tennexxee insa'nenna isoo hinee qici, «No'o uundennexxi ate'ni amannonaa maa manbe'iinka beessisa assitatto? Ati hujjattochchi maachchota? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />‹Indaashsha iimi'ni budeena insa'ne'a uwwe› hiyyende borreessendemmashshann, edik annuwwi no'oki qiilla gammoojje giddo menna indeen,» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Fula. 16:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Far. 78:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen iimatenaa'ni ha'no'a budeena uwweek Muusetebaan; dhugaatika budeena iimatenaa'ni ha'no'a uwwaaki kinni anke Annan. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Mageniink budeeni isi iimatenaa'ni dirraake, kaba butta duuchchike manni'anna hedho uwwaaken.»<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Tennexxee mannikinna isoo, «No'oke Gootta! Konnee budeena duuchchi wodda no'aa uwwi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Hedhotik budeen anten. Anibaa dagaak ijje solo'wabaan; ane'ni amanaakinna ijje dheebo'wabaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Yaane kinni Ani ha'no'n kulenneshshanni anee uuddineexxi midde amandinabaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Aabi ani'a uwwaak duuchchi anibaa dagaan. Anibaa dagaaka haranga gadhi'a shorrabe'no. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ani iimatenaa'ni dagenechchi fedhii anxa assonnaate kaddebaak anee ergemmakixxa edhii muuxonna'aaten. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Anee ergeekixxi fedhii, ani'a uwwemmake duuchchanaa'ni mittekanna midde belleesebe'nong udumixxe barra'ni ke'isannoshshaten. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Anke Annixxi fedhii Belto isika uudakinna iso'ni amanaak duuchchi, duuchchi woddixxe hedho alfaashshaten. Aninna udumixxe barra'ni isoo ke'isannon.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ayihudikinna, «Iimatenaa'ni dageek budeen anten» hiyyemmaxxee iso'n maammuqate'n ke'e. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Insa'nenna, «Kunni anna isikanna ama isixxa egenneennenge Yooseefike belto Yessuusindebaa? Ta'ata hitta isi ‹Ani iimatenaa'n dagennen› hiyya?» hine.<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiisseexxi hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo weli'ann weli maammuqinoqqe'e. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Anee ergeek Aabii anibaa iyyedaga gophoole ayyinna anibaa dagatee dande'aak hedhebaan; Aninna udumixxe barra'ni isoo reyotenaa'n ke'issannon. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Wabeekotike maxaafa'n, ‹Duuchchiing Magenokenaa'n barateeke kadaan› hiyyendee borreessendeen. Tennexxe Aabixxa laqeexxi isonaa'ni barataak duuchchi anibaa dagaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa. 54:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Iitta hiyya Mageniinbaa'ni kadeeke malee Aabii uudeeki ayyinna hedhebaan; Aabii uudeek isoo callan. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyanen ane'ni amanaak duuchchi duuchchin woddixxe hedho afe'een. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ani hedhotike budeenan; <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Edik ha'nook annuwwi qiilla gammoojje giddo menna inde, kaddo malee renne. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Yaane kinni Iimi'ni dirreek budeen konneten; konee budeena itaak reyabaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Iimi'n dirreek hedhotik budeen anten. Huuni manjinna konnee budeeninaa'n itoole isi duuchchi woddi'a hedhaan. Kunni budeeninna kaba butta duuchchike manni'a hedhote kadaasha ani uwwanoke anke maalan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ayihudi, «Kunni manjichchi maala ifika indonna'a hitta no'aa uwwa dande'a?» hiyya'ni weli'aanni weli jaba qico moromme. <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yessusinna insa'ne'ni hiyyee qici, «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen ha'noo Manjiinke Beltika maala ita gophphinoolenna munde isixxa ha'wa gophphinoole umo ha'nongee hedho affinebaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Maala anka itaakinna munde anxa ha'waak, duuchchi woddixxe hedho afeen; Aninna udumixxe barra'ni reyotena'ni isoo ke'isannon. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Maali anki dhugaatixxe itan; munde anxinna dhugaatixxe ha'wan. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Maala anka itaakinna munde anxa ha'waak ane'n hedhaan; aninna iso'ni hedhannon. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Hedhaak Aabii anee ergemmashshanni aninna isinaa'ni kexxeexxa hedhoti hedhaneeke kadenneshshann anee itaakinna iittanni anenaa'ni kexxeexxa hedhoti hedhaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Iimi'ni dirreek budeen konneten; edik ha'nook annuwwi menna itee reyeen; konnee budeena itaaki kinn duuchchi woddi'a hedhaan.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Isinna tennee haaso'ek Qifirnahoomi Muuseka seera barantammake mine'ni barachchiisate'ni hedhemma woddan.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Heddo Hordofeeyye Yessuusii'i Hordofa Waalde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Isixxe hordofeeyye giddii'ni heddo tennee laqqaa wodda, «Kunni yo'oshsha ha'ureeke hiyyichchon; ayyete konnee hiyyichcho adhdha dandee'a?» hite. <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Hordofeeyye isixxinna tenne yaane'ni maammuqeexxa Yessuusi umo ifingenninni ege'neexxi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Tinni yaane ha'noo guggufachchiisaaxxee? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yoona Manjiink Belti edo hedhemmaba'a iimi'a me'aa'naa ha'no uudinoole maa hitino'aate? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Mageniink Hafuuri hedho uwwaan; maal kinni mitte la'onna uwwabaan. Ani ha'no'n kulenneki hiyyichchi hedhoten; Hafuuraken; <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />kaddo malee ha'no giddii'ni mitti mitti amanabaake hedheen.» Tenneenna Yessuusi haaso'eechchi ayyi amanebaaxxanna ayyi isoo sa'isse uwwaaxxa edonni ege'neemmaxxeten. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Isinna lebeexxi, « ‹Ha'no'n Aabibaa'ni eeti uwwendeeke kaddoole malee ayyinna Anibaa daga dande'aak hedhebaan› hiyyenechchi tennexxeeten» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Eetenne yanna'ni hordofeeyye isixxi giddii'ni heddi udumi'a hige; insa'nenna ookkoneechchi udma isoo hordonfebaan. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yessuusinna tommenna lamiinxa ifixxa hordofeeyye, «Ha'noo me'itino'a hassina'nebaan hiyyatebata?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Ookkone wodda Simi'ooni Pheexiroosi iso'n hiyyee hiise haaso'ee qici, «No'oke Goottaa! No'o ayyiba me'inanno? Ati duuchchin woddixxe hedhoke hiyyichcho affeetten. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Ati mittechcho, Mageniinke Woyyichcha kaddetexxa no'o egenneennen, amanneennen.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat. 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar. 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luq. 9:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Tommenna lamiinga ha'noo fi'lenneki Aneendemmabaa? Yaane kinni ha'noo giddii'ni mitti durriisaken» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Isinna tennee hiyyeechchi Simi'oonike beltixxe Asiqorootuke Yihudaxxeeten; Yihuda tommenna lame hordofeeye giddii'ni mitteke kadoolenna Yessuusii'i sa'isse uwwaak isote kademmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Fooqiinka Ayyaani Ulfeesseemmamabaa Me'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi, ookkoo hedhemmak Ayihudi isoo shiyo'a hasaammaxxee isi Yihudake boga'n mammarema waaleexxi Geliila mammaremaamman. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Eettene yanna Ayihudiink fooqiink ayyaan shiqeemman:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lew. 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:13">Lew. 16:13</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Tennexxee Yessuusik dayyuwwi iso hiyyee qici, «Hordofeeyye atixxi, ati hujjaatexxa huje uuddo'aa ati kabaa'ni Yihuda'a me'i. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ifi farri asso'a haassa'ni sho'ik hujaak ayyinna hedhebaan. Atinna tenne yaane duuchcha assitaattole umo atika konne butta duuchchike manna'n leelliishi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Tennenna hiyyatee gennechchi ising dayyuwwi midde iso'ni amana gopheemmaxxeten. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yessuusinna insa'nen hiyyee qici, «Yanna anxi ta'i qico gelte'eebaan: ha'no'aa kinn hiini yannanna elde'eexxen. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Butta duuchcha ha'noo giba dandeettabaan; yaane kinn Anee gibbaachchi kaba buttixxi huje elobaaxxe kaddeexxa ani dhugaa kulaannaxxeeten. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ha'noo konne ayyaanibaa me'e. Ani'aa yanna ta'i qico geya gophpheemmaxxee ayyaanibaa marabo'no.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Isinna tennee insa'ne'n hiyyeexxi Geliilanni gate.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Kaddo malee isiki dayyuwwi ayyaniibaa me'eechchi uduma isinna ayye'ninna leellebaang sho'iki ayyaniibaa me'e. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ookkone ayyaana'n Ayihudi «Iikki manjichchi haba hedhe?» hiyya'ni isoo hasaamman. <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Isixxee ardi giddo lumoxxi hashashsho hexxemman. Mitti mitti manni, «Isi eloke manjon» hiyyaa wodda. Weli kinn, «Waawwoti isi arda dedhisaaken» hine. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kaddo malee manni Ayihuda soda'aatenaa'ni kexxeexxa isixxee farri asseexxi haaso'aammaki hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Ayyaanake'ni Afemeexxi Barachchiisseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ayyaanna ulfeessatixxe oddo'ni genneexxe yanna'ni Yessuusi Woyyichchi Galmibaa mareexxi barachchiisa safe. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ayihudikinna tennee mambe'a hiyyati, «Kunni manjichchi baratebaang hitta maxaafuwwa ege'na dande'e?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yessuusinna insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Ani berachchiisaanexxi barachchiisa umo ankixxe kaddebaak anee ergekenaa'ni daggeexxen. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ayyinna Mageniinxa fedhii asso'a hasoole barachcho anxi Mageniibaa'ni yookaan anenaa'ni daggeexxa foyee ege'naani. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ifike umixxa haaso'ak ifinge ulfinna hasaan; isoo ergeekika ulfinna hasaak kinn isi dhugaatiken; dharikinna iso'ni hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Muuse ha'no'aa seera uwwemmabaata? Yaane kinn ha'noo mittikinna seera ookkonee wonshitinebaan. Mayeete ha'noo anee shiltino'a hassina'neeki?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Ardikinna, «Ati fuggichcha hafuura affeetten; ayyete atee shiyo'a hasaak?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiisse hiyyee haaso'ee qici, «Ani mitte mambe'iinxa huje hujennele, eettene huje'ni ha'no duuchchiing mambe'a hitinaan. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Muuse jila ofo'lishatika seera ha'no'n uwween; kunni seeri kinn edike annuwwinaa'n afeemeeke malee Muusenaa'nitebaan. Kaddo malee ha'no edike sanbatixxa barra oose jila ofo'lishina'neen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Dada. 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew. 12:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Muusek seeri diigemabaashsha annoole edi sanbata'ni ha'noo jila ofo'lishina'neexxenni, ani manna edike sanbata'n fayyisenaxxee mayeeta ane'ni mufatina?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yoh. 5:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Ha'no manjo alba uudina'ni murte mura waaldineexxi dhugaatixxa murte murre!»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Kirisitoosite Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Eettene yanna Iyyerusaalemi hedhemmak mitti mitt manni hiyyee qici, «Shinno'a hansa'neek manjichchi konnendebaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kunse isi farri asse haaso'a'neen: insa'nenna mittechchonna iso'n haasonna'nebaan; kunni manjichchi Kiristoosite kadeexxa baallomiink manni dhugaandinni ege'nu'uu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Yaane kinni kunni manjichchi haba'ike kadeexxa no'o egenneennen. Kiristoosi dagaa woddaqa habaa'nite kadeexxa ege'naak mittikinna hedhebaan.» <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi Woyyichchi Galmixxe baxxe'ni barachchiisa'ni hafuura gikki asseexxi hiyyee qici, «Eeti, ha'no anee egedine'een, habaa'nite kadeenexxanna ha'no egedine'een. Ani kaba hedheeneki anke uminnitebaan; yaane kinni anee ergeek isi dhugaatiken. Ha'no isoo egendinebaan; <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />yaane kinn ani isibaa'ni dagennaxxee, isinna anee ergemaxxee isoo ege'neennen.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Tennexxee insa'nenna isoo abindo'a hanse: yaane kinn yanna geya gophphemmaxxee ayyinna isoo abidebaan. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ardi giddii'n heddi iso'ni amaneexxi, «Yoona Kiristoosi dagaa wodda kunni manjichchi huja'neeka mambe'iinka beessisuwwa sa'eeka assaan?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Heqqanjuwwi Yessuusii Abido'a Ergeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Feerisitotinna ardi isixxee hashasha'n haaso'a'naa laqqe: qeesetik sooreessuwwinna Feeristo isoo abindaashsha Woyyichcha Galma heqqammakaara iisbaa eregine. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yessuusinna hiyyee qici, «Ani ha'noonni welti turaanneki heenooxxe yannani; ookkonechchi uduma anee ergemmakibaa me'annon; <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />ha'no anee hassinaan; yaane kinn anee affinabaan; ani hedhennebaa ha'noo daga dandetinaba'a.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ayihudikinna weli'aanni weli, «Konne manjichcho afatee dandeennabe'nochchi isi habaa me'a hedeete? Dedha isi Girike giddo xexxeereeme hedha'neeke no'oke firiba mareexxi Girikoota barachchiiso'a haseete kadduuni? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />‹Ha'no anee hassinaani yaane kinni anee affinabaan› iittanni, ‹Ha'no ani hedhennebaa daga dandeetinabaan› hiyya'neek maa hiyyateete?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ayyaaniinke muuxama'ni eettene lumoxxe barra'ni Yessuusi uurre'e hafuura gikki asseexxi hiyyee qic, «Ayyinna dheebo'weeki hedhoole anibaa dageexxi ha'wowwaal!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lew. 23:36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ane'ni amanaak Woyyichchi maxaafi hiyyemmashshanni hedhotike wode'ixxi muumme isi giddii'ni phu'issaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz. 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zek. 14:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Isinna tennee haso'eechchi iso'n amanaak manni adhdhaake Woyyichchi Hafuurixxeemmaten; tinninna kaddeechchi Yessuusi ulfiniinba geya gopheemmaxxee Woyyichchi Hafuur uwwemeemmabaan.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ardi giddii'n mitti mitti hiyyichcho isika laqeexxi, «Kunn manjichchi dhugaandinni wabeekaken» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Welikinna, «Isi Kiristoositen» hiyye; iittanni weli manni hiyyee qici, «Kirsitoosi hitta Geliilaa'n daga dande'a? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Woyyichchi maxaafi Kiristoosi Daawwitixxe sannenaa'ni, Daawwiti hedhammabaa'ni, Beeteliheemii'n dagaaxxa kulaammabaata?» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam. 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5">Mik. 5</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 2">2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Tennexxee Yessuusixxe buuttonni ardiinxe oddo'ni gargar higa kadde. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Mitti mitti isoo abido'a hase; yaane kinni ayyinna isoo angati abideba'a.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihudike Akeekisanjuwwixxa Amana Gopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Woyyichcha Galma heqqammak heqqanjuwwi qeesetike sooreessuwwibaanna Feerisitotibaa ille iima higeexxi me'e; insa'nenna Woyyichcha Galma heqqammakaara, «Ha'noo mayee isoo iyyedaga gophphine?» hine. <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Woyyichcha Galma heqqammakiirinna, «Kunni manjichchi haaso'a'neeshsha haranga ayyinna haaso'e ege'neba'a» hiyya'n hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Feerisitotinna hiisiteexxi hite haasotee qici, «Ha'nonna sobendineen hiyyatee? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Meya baallomeekeerinaa'ninna yookaan Feerisitotenaa'n iso'ni amaneeki hedhee? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Muuseka seera ege'nabaak kunni ardi kinni badinemeeken.» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Konneechchi edo Yessuusibaa mare'eemmakinna insa'nenaa'n mitteke kadeek Niqodimoosi insa'nee hiyyee qic, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«No'oke seeri mitte manjixxi ku'la edisseexxi laqendebaakinna isi maa asseexxa ege'nedebaak iso'ni murte muraata?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Insa'ne iso'ni, «Atinna Geliilanaa'nitee? Wabeekichchi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lame olmixxi tikuwwa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wabeekichchi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hitaan</char></note>Galiilanaa'n ke'abaaxxa Woyyichcha maxaafa qortee qo'nise affatton» hineexxi hiissine haasonne.<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ookkoneechchi uduma mitti mittiing ifi ifike minibaa me'e.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yabaabulumati Abidendeexxa Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yessuusi kinni Debire Zayiti'a me'e. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Langa baro gorsa isi Woyyichchi Galmixxe baxxe'ni higgeenni leelle; ardikinna isike qarqara'ni bukki hiyye; isinna ofo'le insa'nee barachchiisate'ni ke'e. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Muuseke seerik barachchiisalluwwinna Feerisito yabaabulda'na'a abindeexxa manjichcho isibaa iyyedange; ardiinxe oddo'ninna isee uurinse. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Insa'nenna Yessuusi'n hinee qici, «Barachchiisalloo tinni manjichcho yabaabulda'naa abindeennen. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Muusenna iitta iseshsha hexxeexxi melaalle kinjik cancaqendaashsha ookkone seera'ni ajaje'een. Atita maa hitaattee?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lew. 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 22:22-24">Lew. 22:22-24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Insa'nenna konne qortuma iso'n shiqinseechchi isoo ku'linaaxxa yaane alfatee isoo hega uundo'a hanseeten. Yaane kinn Yessuusi heeshshi hiyyeexxi qubichchik buttinake'ni borreesa safe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Insa'nenna lenbe lenbe iso'o qorre wodda, isinna toggi hiyyeexxi insa'ne'n, «Ha'no giddii'ni cubbo afebaak isi ediseexxi ise'ni kinjo darbowwaal!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Higgeenni butti'a heeshshi hiyyeexxi buttinake'ni borreesse.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Insa'ne tennee lanqeeshshanni, geedhetenaa'ni sanfeexxi mitti mittiki fulle; tennexxee Yessuusi oddote'n uuriteemmaxxe eettene manjichcho callinni qoffitti gate. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yessuusinna qokki hiyyeexxi isee, «Tee manjichcho atee ku'lammak iikki manni haba hedhe? Ate'ni mureek mitti manjinna hedhebaata?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Isenna, «Goottaa mittikinna hedhebaan» hite. Yessuusinna isee «Aninna ate'ni murabe'non; kexxe me'i; konneechchi edi'a kinn cubbo hujjoxxe!» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxi Dhugaa Kula Dhugaatixxe Kaddeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yessuusi higgeenn mannake'n «Ani butta duuchchike ifani; anee hordofaakinna hedhotike ifa alfaa malee hara dukkanate'ni maremabaan» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yoh. 9:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Feerisitotinna Yessuusii'i, «Ati umo atikixxee dhugaa kuldaaten; dhugaa kula atixxi kinni adhdhendaaxxebaan» hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yoh. 5:31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yessuusinna hiissexxi insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ani umo ankixxee dhugaa kulonolenna habaa'ni dagennexxanna ta'a haba'a me'aannexxa ege'neennaxxee dhugaa kula anxi dhugaatixxen; yaane kinn ha'no ani habaa'n dagennexxa yookaan haba'a me'aannexxa egendineechchi hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ha'noo manjiinke hedumishsha murtinaan; Ani ayye'ninna murabe'no. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ani muronnolenna anee ergeeke Aabinni weltite malee qofitti hedha gophennaxxee murte anxi dhugaatixxen. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Lame manjixxi dhugaa kula adhdhendaaxxa seera ha'nooke'n borreessende'een. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Anke umixxee dhugaa kulaannok mitti anendeni; wele anxi dhugaa kula anee ergeeke Aabiten.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nenna Yessuusii'i, «Anni atiki haba hedhe?» hine; Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Ha'no Anna ankanna aneenna egenidinebaan; sila anee egendine'eele, Anna ankanna egedinamman» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yessuusinna tennee yaane haaso'eek Woyyichchi Galmike dalla'i giddo miya masseccatike mini bira barachchiisa'neetemman; kaddo malee yanna isixxi geya gophpheemmaxxee ayyinna isoo abideek hedheba'a.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Amanabaaka Manna Xexxe'achchiise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yessuusi higgeen insa'ne'ni, «Ani me'annon ha'noonna anee hassinaan; cubbo ha'nooxxenninna rertinaan. Ani me'annobaa kinn ha'noo daga dendeetinabaan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ayihudiink sooreessuwwi, « ‹Isi ani me'anobaa ha'noo daga dandeetinabaan› hiyyeechchi dedha ifi shi'wo'aate kadduun?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Isi kinn insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo kaba buttii'niten; ani iimii'niten. Ha'noo kaba butta duuchchiinaa'niten, ani tenne butta duuchchinaa'nitebaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Cubbo ha'nooxxenninni rertinaaxxa ani ha'no'n kuleennen; Ani isoteni ha'noo'ni hiyyanno wodda, Ani isote kadeennexxa ha'noo amana gophphinoole cubbo ha'nooxxenni rertinaan.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Insa'nenna hiissineexxi, «Yoonata ati ayyete?» hineexxi qorre. Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiissee qici, «Siretenaa'ni ke'isennexxi ha'no'aa kulennek Ani isoten. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ani ha'noo'ni heddo haaso'annoxxinna heddo murannoxxi yaane hexxeen. Yaane kinn Anee ergeek isi addatemeeken; Aninna isonaa'ni laqennexxa kaba butta duuchcha'n haaso'annon.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne Yessuusi Aabixxee haaso'a'neemmaxxa qaabanteemmaba'a. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Tennexxee Yessuusi hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo Manjiinka Belto iimi'a shikki assitineexxi fannissinaa wodda, iikki ani hiyyannak isi ante kadeennexxanna Aabi anee barachchiiseexxa kulaannoxxa, fedhii anxenni mitteechchonna assabe'noxxa ha'no egendinaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Anee ergeek isi aninni welti hedheen; Ani duuchchi wodda isoo gammachchiissaaxxa assaannaxxee isi anee qofi waalebaan.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Isinna tennee haaso'eshshanni heddi manni iso'ni amane.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cubbotixxe Garbummanaa'ni Leexa Fula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yessuusinna iso'ni amaneemmaka Ayihuda'n hiyyee qici, «Ha'noo anxe barachcho'ni hexxinoole dhugaaten, ha'noo anxe hordofeeyyen. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Ookkonneechchi uduma ha'noo dhugaatanna egendinaan; dhugaatinna ha'noo leexa fulchitaan.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Insa'nenna, «No'o Abirihaamixxe ilan; no'o ayyi'aanna garbake kande egenebe'non; yoona ati no'oo hitta ‹leexa fuldinaan› hitatto?» hineexxi hiissene haasonne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat. 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luq. 3:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiissee qici, «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen; cubbo hujaak isi cubbotike garban. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Garbi duuchchinni wodda mini hadi giddo hedhabaan; belti kinni duuchchinni wodda mine hedhaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Tennexxee Mageniink Belti leexa ha'noo fulchoole dhugaaten, ha'no leexa fuldinaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ani ha'no Abirihaamixxe ila kaddineexxa ege'neennen. Yaane kinn ha'no hiyyichcho anka adhdha gophphinnaammaxxee anee shiltino'a ka'litinee kexxine'een. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Ani anke Annibaa'n uudennexxe yaane haaso'aannen. Ha'nonna ha'nooke anninaa'ni laqqineexxe assitinaan.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Insa'nenna iso'n, «Anni no'ok Abirihaamiten» hineexxi hiisine haasonne. Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ha'no Abirihaamixxe ila kaddino'oole, sila Abirihaami hujeexxe hujjinamman. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Magenokenaa'n laqennexxa dhugaa ha'noo'a kulenenga anee shiltino'a ka'litine kexxine'een; Abirihaami kinni iitta assebaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ha'noo assitina'neeki anni ha'nook assaammanxen.» Insa'nenna, «No'o yabaabullet ilemmennekebaan; no'oki Anninna mitte Mageno callan» hineexxi hiisine haasonne.<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daabiloosixxa Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yessuusi insa'ne'n hiyyeexxi hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Mageni ha'nooke Anna kade'eele, ani Mageniibaa'ni dagennaxxee sila anee eetinamman; yaane kinni isi anee ergee'naa dagenne malee ani ifike uminni dagebe'non. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Haaso'annexxa mayeete qaabbata gophphina'neek? Tinninna ha'noo hiyyichcho anka laqa dande'a gophphineemmaxxeteen. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Ha'no anna ha'nooke dabiloosixxe oosen; ha'nooke annixxa halchanna muuxxino'a hassinaan. Isi sirendenaa'ninn anga sa'eeken: Dhugaa iso'ni hedha gophpheemmaxxee isi dhugaati welti mittooma afebaan; isi dharrichchakenna dhariinke anna kademmaxxee dhara haaso'aa wodda, isi haaso'aaxxi ifike umixxen. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Yaane kinni ani dhugaa haaso'aannaxxee anee amandinabaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ha'noo giddii'n anee cubbaleessaken hiyyee ku'la dande'aak hedheeta? Yoona ani dhugaa haaso'aanneke kadeennexxenni mayeeta anee amana gophphina? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Magenibaa'nite kadeek isi Mageni hiyyaaxxa laqaan. Ha'no kinni Magenibaa'nite kada gophphinemmaxxee laqqinabaan.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Abirhaami'a Edin Darre Hedhemman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayihudi Yessuusii'i, «Ati Semaarichchoken; fuggichcha hafuura affeeten hiyya no'oxxi dhugaandebaata?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'a hiyyee hiise haaso'ee qici, «Ani Anna anka ulfeessaane malee fuggichcha hafuura afeebe'non; ha'no kinn anee salphisinaan. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Ani anke umika ulfinna hasabe'no; kaddo malee ani ulfeesemonnaa hasaak weli hedheen; muraakinna isoten. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen, ayyinna hiyyichcho anka heqqedhoole haranga reyabaan.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ayihudikinna iso'n hiyyee qici, «Fuggichcha hafuura affeettexxa no'o ta'a reefi egennennen; Abirihaami reye; wabeekotinna rerteen; ati kinn ‹Hiyyichcho anka heqqedhaak› reyabaan hittaatte. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ati anna no'oke Abirihaaminaa'n saxxattota? Isi reyeen; wobeekotinna rerteen; atita ifi ayyete hittotta'aate?»<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yessuusinna hiyya'n hiissee haaso'ee qici, «Ani ifi ulfeesaannole ulfinni anki toliinken; anee ulfeessaak kinni ha'no Magenoken hitina'neeke anke Annan. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Kaddo malee ha'no isoo egendinebaan; ani isoo ege'neennen. Ani isoo ege'nebe'non hiyyennele aninna ha'nooshshanni dharichchake kadeennan hiyyaten. Kaddo malee ani isoo ege'neennen; hiyyichcho isikanna heqqedhannon. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Anna ha'nooke Abirihaamixxi halcha barra anxa uudeexxi gammado'atemman; iseenna uudeexxi gammade.»<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Tennexxee Ayihudi isoo, «Ati onde tomme wogga wo'mitebexxok hittata Abirihaamii'i uuddeennen hittatto?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyannen, Abirihaami ilemebaa edi darre ani anten» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Eettene yanna'ni insa'ne isoo cancanqo'a kino adhdhine; Yessuusi kinn insa'nenaa'ni miliqeexxi Woyyichchi Galmi giddii'ni fule me'e.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Balla'ake Kedeexxi Iemeeka Manjichcho Fayyise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yessuusi ora sa'aa'neege'ni balla'ake kadeexxi ilemeeka manjichcho uude. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Hordofeeye isixxinna Yessuusii'i, «Barachchiisalloo kunni manjichchi balla'ake kadeexxi ilemaashsha cubbo hujeeki ayyete? Isi ifi'a hujeexxe cubbo'ate moo yookaan isike hadixxe cubboxxeete?» hite qorte. <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yessuusinna hiyye hiissee qici: «Isi yookaani hadi isiki cubbo hujebaan; tinni kaddeechchi Mageniinxi huje isixxe hedho'ni leellitaashshaten. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Barra hexxee'naanni anee eregemmakixxa huje ani huja hasissaan; fedheek manji hujatee dande'abaaxxe hashsha daggaan. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ani butta duuchcha'ni hedhennexxenni Ani butta duuchchike ifan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat. 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh. 8:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Isinna tennee hiyyeechchi uduma buttinake'n hancufa tufe'e buttinakanna dhoqqete asse'e manjichchiinxe ille'n iseexxi, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />«Isoonna martettexxi Selehoomike xammanqammake baleessa'ni anshedhi!» hiyye. «Selihoomi» hiyya «Ergemeeke» hiyyaten. Tennexxe manjichchikinna mare anshedhe uuda'ni illee iima hige dage.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Olla'i isikinna edi wodda kadhata'naa uudaammak manni, «Kunni manjichchi ofo'leexxi kadhataammakemmabaa?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Mitti mitti mannina «Dhugaanda isonden» hiyye. «Weli mannina isoo fakkata'nee malee isotebaan» hiyye. Isi kinn, «Anendeqqa» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Mannikinna isoo, «Yoona ille atixxi hitta kadde banendetaa?» hine qorre. <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Isinna «Yessuusite hinaak manjichchi buttina dhoqqete asse ille anxe'ni isseexxi; ‹Selihoomi mare'e anshedhonnaa ane'ni kule!› Aninna mare anshedhennexxi uuda dande'enne» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Insa'nenna, «Iikki manjichchi habata hedhee?» hine. Isinna «Ani haba hedheenxa ege'nebo'non» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Feriisito Iikki Manjichchi Hitta Kade Fayyeexxa Qodhdhate'ni Ke'neexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Mannikinna ille ba'eemmaka manjichcho Feerisitotibaa iyyemare. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Yessuusi dhoqqe isseexxi manjichchiinxa ille baneeki Edi Sanbatixxe barramman. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Tennexxe Feerisitotinna hitta uudate dande'eexxa higgeenna isoo qorte. Manjichchikinna insa'nen, «Isi dhoqqe ille anxe'n buureen; aninna anshedhennexxi kunna'a ta'a uudannen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Feerisitoti giddii'n mitti mitti manni, «Kunni manjichchi Edi Sanbata ulfeessa gopheemmaxxee isi Mageniba'nitebaan» hiyye. Weli manni kinni, «Cubbaleessake kadeek manjichchi iitta hedheeka mambe'uwwiinka beessisuwwa hitta assa dande'aa?» hiyye. Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa insa'nexxe oddo'n garga higa kadde. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Tennexxee insa'nenna ille ba'emmake manjichchibaa higgeenni marreexxi, «Ati konne ille atixxa baneeke manjichchixxee yoona ati maa hitaatte?» hine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Manjichchikinna hiisseexxi, «Isi wabeekaken» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ayihudikinna kunni manjichchi balla'ake kadeexxanna ta'a ille isixxi hitta banendeexxa isoo ilemmaka hado ye'eexxi laqaa qico'n amaneemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Insa'nenna isoo ilemmaka hado ye'neexxi «Balla'ake kade ilemeen hitina'neek ha'nook belti konnetee? Ta'ata hitta kadeeta uuda dande'e?» hineexi qorre. <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Hadi isikinna hiyyeexxi hiissee haaso'ee qici, «Belto no'oke kadeexanna balla'ake kadeexxi ilemeexxa no'o egenneennen. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ta'a kinn hitta uuda dande'eexxanna ille isixxa ayyi isi'aa baneexxa no'o egennebe'non. Isi umo ifikenni lumoke manjo kadeemmaxxeenna haaso'aa dande'aammaxxe'e isoonni qorre.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Hadi isiki iitta hiyyeechchi, Yessuusii'i, «Isi Kiristoositeni» hiyyaak manji hedheexxe kaddoole Muuseka seera barrachchotike minenaa'n Ayihudi isoo fulchatee weli aagemmaaxxee insa'nee sodaateettemman. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Tennexxee hadi isik «Isi lumoke manjon isoonn qorre!»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Insa'nenna ille ba'eemmaka manjichcho higgeenni ye'neexxi isoo, «Koo manjichcho, ati Mageno ulfeessi kunn manjichchi cubbaleessake kadeexxa no'o egeneennen» hine. <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Isinna, «Isi cubbaleessake kadeexxa ani ege'nebe'no. Yaane kinn ani balla'ake kadeennaxxanna ta'a kinn uudaannexxa tenne mitte yaane ege'neennen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Insa'nenna isoo, «Isi ati'a maa asse? Ille atixxa hitta asse bane?» hineexxi qorre. <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Isinna insa'ne'n «Ediseenni ani ha'no'a kuleennan; ha'no kinn ani hiyyennexxa laqqinebaan; mayeeta higgeenna laqqino'a hassine? Ha'noonna hordofeeyye isixxe kaddino'a hassina'nee?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'nee isoo cee'mine yowwina'ni hinee qici, «Konne manjichchiki hordofalli ateten; no'o Muusexxe hordofeeyyen! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />No'o Mageni Muuse'n haaso'eexxa egeneennen; kunni manjichchi kinn habaa'n dageexxa midde no'o egenebe'non» hine. <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Manjichikinna insa'ne'n hiisseexxi hiyyee haaso'ee qici, «Ha'noo isi habaa'ni dageexxa ege'na gopha ha'nooxxi mambe'aken; kaddo malee ille anxa baneek isoten. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Mageni laqaak isoo sodaatakanna fedhii isixxa assaake maalee cubbaleeyyetixxa laqabaaxxa no'o ege'nenneenn. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Balla'ake kadeexxi ilemeeke manjixxa ille baneeki hedheen hiyyenda'naa butta duuchcha dadendeexxe barranaa'ni ta'i qico'n ayyinna laqe ege'nebaan. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Kunni manjichchi, Magenibaa'nite kada gopheele sila tennee assa dande'ammabaan.»<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Insa'nenna, «Koo cubbo ate'n gundee'na ilendeetteki ati no'oo hitta barachchiisatto?» hina'n Muuseke seerike barachchotike minenaa'n isoo shorrine.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qalbetixxa Balla'umma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yessuusinna manjichcho shorrineexxa laqe; Isinna manjichchik afemeechchi uduma isoo «Manjiinke Belto'ni amandaatte?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Manjichchikinna, «Anke goottaa Ani iso'ni amannonaa isi ayyete?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yessuusinna manjichchoke'n, «Ati isoo uuddeetten; ta'anna atinni welti haasosa'neek isoten» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Manjichchikinna, «Goottaa amanaannen» hiyyeexxi isi'a sagade. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yessuusinna, «Ballu'uwwi uudaashsha uudammakiirinna balla'ake kadaashsha murtetee kaba butta dageennen» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Isinni welti hexxeemmaxxe Feerisito giddii'ni mitti mitti konne haaso'a lanqeexxi isoo, «Tinni maa hiyyate? No'onnata balla'uwwaken hiyyatee?» hine.<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Ha'no balla'ake kaddine'eele silaan ha'noo'ni cubbote kaddammabaan; ta'a kinn uundaanneen hitinaammaxxee cubbaleeyyende kaddinee gattinaan» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Allalisanjokanna Isika Gedhebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />«Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyannen, gedhebiinxe goodhexxe hulanaa'nite kaddebaak welebaa'ni e'yaaki isi modhalchokenna mulqedhaaken. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Eettene hulanaa'n e'yaaki kinn isi gedhebiinke allalisanjon. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Iikki hula heqqammak eettenee hula isi'a banaan; gedhebikinna hafuura isika laqaan. Isinna ifika gedhebo summi summik ye'a'ni, akeeka'n gadhi'a fulchaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ifike kadeeka gedhebonna fulcheechchi uduma gedhebii edo me'aan; gedhebikinna hafuura isika ege'nemmaxxee duuka isixxa hordofaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Yaane kinn iikki gedhebi weliinka hafuura ege'na gonpheemmaxxee isonaa'ni bajaa malee haranga isixxa duuka me'abaan.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yessuusinna konne mammaassa insa'ne'n haaso'e; insa'ne kinni isi maa insa'ne'n haaso'eexxa qaalbeefantebaan.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Eloke Allalisanjon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Tennexxee Yessuusi higgeen insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Ani dhugaate ha'no'a hiyyaannen; gedhebiinxi hula anten. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Ani dageebe'no edi darre dageeki duuchchi moodhalshetenna mulqedhaakeeramman; yaane kinn gedhebi insa'neexxa laqebaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Iitti hulanna anten; ani darree'ni e'yaaki duuchchi isi anjiremaan; isi eyya'ninna fulaan; bobba'aabanna alfaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Moodhalchi mooro'a, shiyo'aanna balleessa calli'a dagaan; Ani kinni dagenneechchi hedho alfino'aanna bira saxxeexxi hedho he'naashshaten.»<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />«Eloki allalisanji anten. Elok allalisanji hedho ifixxa gedheboke'e sa'isse uwwaan; <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Gedhebi isike kadebaak rundakee allalaaki dhugaatike allalisanjo kada gophpheemmaxxee kinn yayye daggaa wodda gedhebo waale baajaan; yayyetinna gedhebo bubbuttee xeertaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Iikki allalisani waale baajaachchi rundakee allalaammaxxeenna gedhebokee marara gophaammaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />«Elok allalissanji Aneten; Aninna gedhebo anka ege'neennen; gedhebi Ankinna anee ege'ne'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat. 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:33">Luq. 22:33</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lew. 24:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Tinninna Aabi Anee ege'nemmashshanni; Aninna Aabi'i ege'neennashanden. Aninna hedho anxa anke gedhebia sa'isse uwwannon. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ani tenne goodheke kadebaaka wele gedhebo afeennen. Ani insa'nee iyyedaga hasissaan. Insa'ne hafuura anka lanqaan; mittebanna bobbanaan: allalisanji insa'nekinna mittenge kadaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Lubbo anxa sa'isse uwweennexxi hiisse adhdhannaxxee Aabi anee eeyya'neen. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Hedho anxa feedhi anxenni sa'isse uwwaane malee; ayyinna isee'e Anenaa'ni adhdhabaan; hedho anxa sa'isse uwwateenna kadi adhdhatee Ani baallooma afeennen; Aninna konne ajaja adhdheenneki anke Anninaa'niten.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Konne hiyyichchinaa'ni kexxeexxa Ayihudiinxe oddo'n higgeenni gargar higa kadde. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Insa'nenaa'n heddi manni, «Isi fuggichcha hafuura afe'eeni maraataken. Mayeete ha'noo isixxa laqqina'neek?» hine. <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Weli kinn, «Kunni, fuggichchi hafuur abideeke manjike haaso'abaan; fuggichchi hafuur ille ba'eeke manjichchixxa ille bana dande'aa?» hine.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayihuudi Yessuusii'i Morome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Iyyeerusaalemi giddo Woyyichcha Galma qammalchati ayyaani kade; iitti yannanna haarsottemman. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yessuusinna Woyyichchi Galmixxe baxxeba Solomooni mammaremammaxxe ba'laxxe soronaa'ni sa'aa'nemman. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ookkone wodda Ayihudi isoo oddote'ni qoqqobeexxi, «Haani qico'n ati no'oo memmi assita'ni hexxatto? Ati Kiristoosite kaddoottole amoo farri assite no'aa kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyyeexxi hiissee qici, «Aniqqa ha'noo'ni kuleennan; ha'noo kinn amandinabaan. Ani anke Annike summinni assaannek beessisuwwi kunni anxee dhugaa kula'neen. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ha'noo kinn anke gedhebo kada gophphineemmaxxee amandinabaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Anki gedhebi hafuura anka laqaan; Aninna insa'nee ege'nennen. Insa'nenna anee hordonfaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Ani duuchchi woddixxa hedho insa'ne'aa uwwannon; haranga ba'nabaan; anga anxenaa'n insa'nee dandeexxi bute adhdhaaki ayyinna hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Insa'nee ani'aa uwweek Ank Anni duuchchingenaa'n sa'aken; anke Annixxe anganaa'ni ayyinna insa'nee buteexxi adhdha dande'abaan. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Aninna Aabi mitteken.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Higgeenni Ayihudi Yessuusii cancanqo'a kino adhdhe; <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Aabibaa'ni uwwemeeka heddo lumolla beessissuwwa ha'no'n leellisheennen; eegerta'a konneeranaa'ni hoonexxee, anee kinjik cancaqqino'aate?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayihudikinna iso'n, «No'o atee cancanqaannechchi ati manjonge kaddee, ifi Magenoke assitee, yowwichchiinka haaso'a haasottettexxeete malee wele yaanexxeetebaan» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiyye hiissee qici, «Ha'nooke seera'ni, ‹Ha'noo magenuwwaken hiyyennen› hiyyende borreessedebaa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Far. 82:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Yoonna Woyyichcha maxaafa jijjiira dandeesisabaan; Mageniink hiyyichchi insa'ne'aa dageekara Woyyichchi maxaafi ‹Magenuwwaken› hiyye ye'eexxenni; <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />eegerta'a, ‹Ani Mageniink Belton› hiyyeennexxee, Aabi ifi'a foye woyyonseekanna kaba butta duuchi'aa ergeeka ati yowwitaaten hitineexxi mayee ane'ni yaane hassinaa? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Anni anki assa'neexxa assa gophonnole ane'ni amandinoqqee! <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Yaane kinn Ani tennee assaannexee kaddoole anee amana gophphinoolenna midde Aabi ane'ni hedheexxa Aninna Aabi'ni hedhennexxa ha'noo egendinaashshanna qalbeeffattinaashsha Ani hujaannexxe huje'n amanne.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Higgeenni insa'ne Yessuusii abindo'aa wo'laanne; yaane kinni isi anga insa'nexxenaa'n fulchedheexxi me'e.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi edi wodda Yohaannisi xammaqammake Yordanoosike galaani wido higeexxi ookkoo ture.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yoh. 1:28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Heddi manni isibaa dage. Insa'nenna, «Yohaannisi mittekanna mambe'iinka beessisa assebaan; yaane kinn Yohaannisi konne manjichchixxee haaso'eexxi duuchcha dhugaatemman» hine. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ookkone booncho'ninna heddi manni Yessuusi'ni amane.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Alazaarixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Maaramikenna dayyo isexxe Maartake olla'a'ni Biitaaniya hedhammak Alaazaari ela gopheemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Tinn dayyi iseki Alaazaari ela gopheexxi Maarami, Goottake'ni shitto fiffixxe'e lekka isixxa umiinke ordichchi isekinni filteemmaxxemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Tennexxe tinni dayyuwwanna, «No'oke Goottaa! Ati eetattaki manjichchi ela gophedheen» hineexxi manjo iso'ni ergine. <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yessuusinna tennee laqe wodda, «Tinni dhibo Mageniinki Belti ise darree'ni ulufataashsha Mageniinke ulfinni'ate malee isoo reyotee geesissaaxebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yessuusinna Maartaa, dayyo isexxanna Alaazaarii'i eeyya'nemmaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Kaddo malee isi Alaazarixxa ela gonphe laqee wodda ookko hedhemmamba lame barra ture.<verse eid="JHN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ookkonneechchi uduma isi hordofeeyye ifixxa, «Ke'we Yihuda'aa hinge me'ino» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Insa'nenna isoo, «Barachchiisalloo shiixxoxxe yanna edi ga'ma Ayihudi atee kinjiki cancaqo'a hansa'nemman; higgeenni ati ookko'a martattotaa?» hine. <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'a hiyye hiissee qici, «Barrate'ni hexxeexxi saate tommenna lametebaa? Barra maremaak butta duuchika ifa uudammaxxee isi guggufatabaan. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Yaane kinni hashsha maremaaki ifi hedha gopheemmaxxee guggufataan.»<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Isinna tenne insa'ne'ni haaso'echchi uduma, «Jaali no'oki Alaazaari diiphe'een; yaane kinn Ani diiphokenaa'ni isoo ke'issonnaa maraannen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Hordofeeyye isixxinna, «No'oke Gootta! Isi diiphe'eexxe kaddoole fooraan» hine. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yessuusinna tennee insa'ne'aa haaso'echchi Alaazarixxe reyoxxeetemman; hordofeeyye isixxi kinn diiphiinxee haaso'echcho insa'ne'n labbeemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Tennexxe isi farri asse insa'nen hiyyee qici, «Alaazaari reyedheen; <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ha'noo amandinaashsha Ani ookkoo hedha gopheennaxxee ha'nooxxee gammadaannen. Yaane kinni ta'a ke'we isibaa me'ino.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Ookkonneeechchi uduma Didimoosi hiyyemaak Toomaasi wele gatteexxe hordofeeyye'n, «Ke'we no'onna marree isinni welti renno» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yessuusi Ke'ateenna Hedhote Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yessuusi ookkoo mare geye wodda; Alaazari mogemeexxenni shoole barra geyeemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Biitaaniya Iyyerusaaleminaa'n sase kiilometire qico bayyattaan. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ayihudakenaa'n heddi manni Maartanna Maaramii'i insa'neke dayyixxe reyoxxee dayyeeso'aa dageemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Maartanna Yessuusixxa daga laqqeexxi isoo qophexxo'a fulde; Maarami kinni minenni gatteemman. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maartanna Yessuusii hittee qici, «Anke Gootta, silaa ati kaba hexxettele dayyi anki reyammabaan. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Yaane kinn ta'atenna kaddoole ati kadhattaattoxxa duuchcha Mageni ati'a uwwaaxxa Ani ege'neennen.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yessuusinna ise'n, «Dayyi atik ke'aan» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maartanna isi'a hiissiteexxi, «Udumixxa barra ke'atixxe yanna'n isi reyotenaa'ni ke'aaxxa ege'nenneni» hite. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yessuusinna ise'n hiyyee qici, «Ke'atinna hedho anten; Ane'ni amanaak reyoolenna midde isi hedhoti hedhaan; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ane'ni hedhaaki, ane'ni amanaak duuchchinna haranga reyabaan. Ati tennee amandatto?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Isenna hiissiteexxi iso'n, «Eeti, anke Goottaa! Ati kaba butta duuchchiba'a dagaake Kiristoosi Mageniinke Belto kaddettexxa amanannon» hite.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Maartanna tennee haasoteechchi uduma wirri hite higge'e, dayyo isexxa Maaramii'i qofiba yexxeexxi, «Barachchiisalli dagedheen; ateenna hasa'neeni» hite. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maariyaaminna tennee laqqeeshshanni rakke kexxeexxi isibaa marte. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ookkone wodda Yessuusi, Maarta isoo qophexxemmanba hedhemma malee olla'i giddi'a e'yeemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Maaramii'i dayyeessa'ni mini giddo hedhemmak Ayihudinna ise qophphi hite fuldeexxa uudeexxi ise mooggiinba marte ooxxe'neechcho insa'ne'ni labbee'naa duuka isexxa ke'ne fulle. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maaraminna Yessuusii hedhemmaba gelte isoo uudeeshshanni lekka isixxe'ni wabbi hiteexxi, «Anke Gootta, silaa ati kaba hexxeettele dayyi anki reyammabaan» hite. <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yessuusi ise ooxxa'naa iittanni isexxa duuka dageemmak Ayihudinna oodha'naa uudeexxi isi ifi giddo yo'oshsha irriki yaadeexxi, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />«Habate ha'noo isoo moogineebi?» hiyye qore. Insa'nenna «No'oke Gootta amoo uudi!» hine. <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yessuusinna indiddo ile ifixxenaa'n dune. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ookkonneechchi uudma Ayihudikinna hiisseexxi, «Hitta isoo eeyyaammaxxa uudde!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Insa'ne giddii'ni mitti mitti kinn, «Ookkonne balla'ixxa ille baneeki isi, konne manjonna reyabaashsha assa dande'ammabaata?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Alaazarii Reyotenaa'ni Ke'isseexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yessuusi higgeenni yo'oshsha yaadeexxi mooggiinbaa mare. Mooggiinki boonchinna kinjik cufendeexxe wolo'omman. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yessuusinna «Kinjo hoyye!» hiyye. Alaazarixxi dayyo Maartanna isoo, «Anke Gootta reyeexxinni shoole barra turemmaxxee ta'a foole ganaan» hite. <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Ookkonneechchi uudma Yessuusinna hiisseexxi, «Ati amandottole Mageniinka ulfinna uuda uuddattoni hiyye ate'ni kuleennabaa?» ise'aa hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Tennexxe insa'ne kinjo hoyyine. Okkoneechchi uduma Yessuusinna iimi'a uudeexxi hiyyee qici, «Ee, Annayyoo! Ane laqqaattexxee atee galateefataannen. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ati duuchchi wodda anee laqqaattexxa ege'neennen; yaane kinn Ani tennee haaso'enechchi; kaba uurreeki manni ati anee ergitettexxa amanaashshaten.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yessuusinna tennee hiyyeechchi uduma hafuura gikki asseexxi, «Koo Alaazaari amo fuli!» hiyye ye'e. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Reyemmak Alaazarinna anga lekka seemmati mirqemeeshshanni alba isikanna seemmati buqemeeshshanni mooggiinxe balenaa'ni fule. Yessuusinna insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Mirqitinemmaxxa seemmanna tikkineexxi waalle! Me'uuni» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusii'i Shiyatee Mari'antee qico</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luq. 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Tennexxee Maaramibaa dagemmak manni giddi'ni mitti mitti Yessuusi assammaxxa uudeeke Ayihudakenaa'n heddi manni Yessuusi'ni amane. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Insa'ne giddi mitti mitti mareexxi Yessuusi assemmaxxa Feerisitote'n kule. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ookkonneechchi uduma qeesetik sooresuwwinna Feerisito Yihudotiinxi songotixxi gamuwwa bukki hine. Insa'nennaa hinee qici, «Kunni manjichchi heddo mambe'iinka beessisuwwa assaammaxxee isoo'o maa assinennexxa woyya? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Iittanni isoo sammi hine waallonnole manji duuchchi iso'ni amanaan; Roomitotinna daggeexxi woyyitte no'oxxa bakanna arda no'oka kuti assite birtaan.» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ookkonneechchi uduma insa'ne giddi'ni mitti eettene wogga'ni qeesetike umo kadeemmak Qeyyaafa hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Ha'nooqqa egendinegeechchi hedhebaan! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ardi duuchchi ba'eexxi manni'ni ardiinxee mitti manji reyeele eldaaxxe kaddeexxa ha'noo qalbeefatinabaan.» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Isinna tennee haaso'eki umi isikinnitebaan; yaane kinn eettenee wogga'ni isi qeesetika umo kadeemmashshanni, Yessuusi Ayihudiinke ardi'a reya'neexxa raaga haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Reya'nechchinna okkone ardi'a calla kadebaang xexxeredemmaxxa Mageniinxa oose mitteba bukki assatteten.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Tennexxe eettene barrabaa'n ke'neexxi insa'ne isoo shinno'aa mari'ante. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Tennexxee Yessuusi ookkonneechchi kayyi'a Ayihudiinxe oddo'n ba'lifate maremebaan: yaane kinn qiilla gammoojje bira hexxeexxe Efireemi hiyyemaake qachchibaa me'e; isinna ookko hordofeeyye isixxenni welti ture. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ayihudiink sa'atik ayyaani shiqeshshanni; sa'atik ayyaani geyeba edi gama, ca'a hiyyatika seera bidhdhatee heddi manni hedhammange boguwwanaa'n Iyyerusaalemi'a me'e. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Insa'nenna Yessuusii'i hansaamman; insa'nenna Woyyichchi galmi giddo uurrineexxi, «Ha'noo'ni maa labba'ne? Ayyaanakee isi daga gopha'nu?» weli'aani weli hine. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Qeesetiki sooresuwwinna Feerisito Yessuusii'i abiddo'a isi haba hedheexxa ege'naak manji kulaashsha insa'ne'n ajanjeemman.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi'ni Shitto Issiteexxa Manjichcho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat. 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Yessuusinna Sa'atik ayyaani ulfeesemo'a jaane barra gattaa wodda; reyotena'ni ke'isemmak Alaazaari hedhammaba Biitaaniya'a dage. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ookkoo Yessuusi'a hashshixxi ita qophesende Maartanna ergatenda'nemman. Ookkoo itatee Yessuusinn welt ofo'lemmake mannanaa'ni mitti Alaazaaritemman. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Maarami hiri fiixeexxa xarmuusetika gamisa ca'ite Nardoosixxa shitto aaxxe daggeexxi Yessuusixxe lekka'ni issiteen: isenna umiinke ordichchinni lekka isixxa filte. Mini giddonna shittotixxi fishshe wo'mite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luq. 7:37-38</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yaane kinn hordofeeyye isixxi giddii'n mitti, Yessuusii'i sa'isse uwwaak Asiqorootuk Yihuda hiyyee qici, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Tinni shitto sase dhibba Diinare'ni gurgurre'naa konne maallaqa hiyyeyyetee mayee uwwema gophe?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Isi tennee haaso'echchi maallaqiinka subba abidaammak isote kadeemmaxxe'e ookkone massinammake maallaqanaa'ni ifixxe la'o'ni hosisaammake modhalcho kadeemmaxxeete malee isi hiyyeyyetee yaadetebaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yessuusinna hiyyee qici, «Tinni shitto ani moogemannoxxe barra'a qophphesitexxe kaddeemmaxxee isee waalle! <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Hiyyeeyye heene yannanna ha'noonni welti hexxeen; ani kinn duuchchin wodda ha'noon welti hedhabo'non» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 15:11">Lew. 15:11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ookkone wodda heddi Ayihudiink manni Yessuusi Biitaaniya hedheexxa insa'ne egenne dange: dangeechchinna Yessuusixxe'e hineete calla kaddeebaak, Yessuusi reyotenaa'ni ke'isemmaka Alaazaari'i uundo'atemman. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Tennexxe qeesetik sooreesuwwi Alaazaarinna shinno'a mari'ante. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Tinninna Alaazarixxe daafenni heddi Ayihudiink manni Yessuusibaa mara'ni amanaammaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Ulfinnik Iyyerussaalemi'a E'ye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luq. 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Langa barixxa gorsa ayyaanefato'a dageeki heddi ardi Yessuusi Iyyerusaalemi'a daga'neexa laqe. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Insa'ne meexxetika shafa abinde isoo qophe'no'a fulle. Insa'nenna hafuura gikki assineexxi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Hosa'inna! Goottiinke summinni dagaaki eebisemeken!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Isira'eelik moyanji eebbisemeeke!» hina'ni cancine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Far. 118:25-26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yessuusinna harretixxa beltanjo afee ise'ni hana gulfe; tinninna kaddeechchi, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Tee Tsiiyoonnixxe belto sodaattoxxee! Yoona moyanji atiki harretixxe beltanjo'n hana gulufe dagaan» hiyyeme borreessemeeki raagi muuxemo'aten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek. 9:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Hordofeeyye isixxinna tenne yaane duuchcha sirete'n qalbefatemmabaan; yaane kinn Yessuusi ulfaateechchi uduma ookkone wodda tennee isixxe'e borreessendeexxanna insa'nenna tenne isi'a assendeexxa kassi hine.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Isinna Alaazaarii'i mooggokenaa'n ye'e woddanna reyotenaa'ni isoo ke'isse wodda; isinni welti hedhemmaki mann ke'a isixxa dhugaa kullaammani. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Heddi manninna konne mambe'iinka beessisa Yessusi asseexxa laqeemmaxxe'e isoo qophedho'a fule. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Tennexxe Feerisito weli'aanni weli «Yoona maa assa dandeesissa? Uuddineeni! Butta duuchchik ardi iso'o hordofeen» hine.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Reyo Iffixxee Edise Haaso'eexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ayyanake'ni magenoonfachchote dageeke manni giddi'ni mitti mitti Girkeeke mannammani. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Insa'nenna Geliila giddo hexxeexxe Beete sayidake manjo kadeeke Filiphphoosibaa dangeexxi, «Gootta, No'oo Yessuusi'i uundonaa hansaannen» hine. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filiphphoosinna dageexxi Indiriyaasi'ni kule: Indiryaasinna Filphoosi lamiingi ke'ne marreexi Yessuusi'n kulle.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yessuusi hiisseexxi, «Manjiinki Belti ulfessemaaxxi yanna gelteeni. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'aa hiyyaannen; dinnetixxi sanne buttinake'ni ibbe reya gophoole qofinni gattaan: ise rertoole kinn heddo gumma gummissaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luq. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Hedho ifixxa eeyyaaki isee gophaan; kaba butta hedho ifixxa gibaaki kinni duuchchi woddi'a hedho isoo heqqitaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ani'aa erigato'a hasaaki duuchchi anee hordofowwaal. Ani hedhenneba anki erigajinna ookkoo hehdaan; ani'a ergataakanna Anki Aabii isoo ulfeessaan.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Reyo Ifixxee Haaso'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Ta'a fa'i lubbo anxi wixixxi hite'en; yoona maata hiyyanno? Ee, Annayyoo, tenne yanna'ni anee anjiir hiyyootaa? Waawwoti! Iitta hiyyabo'noshsha kinni Ani dagennelchchi tenne rakkotixxe yaane'aten. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ee, Annayyoo, summa atika ulfeesi!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ookkonneechi uduma, «Ani ulfeessennen: higgeenna ulfeesannon» hiyyaak hafuuri iimatena'ni dage. <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ookkoo hedhemmak hafuura isixxa laqeeki heddi manni, «Dindinsoten» hine. Weli kinn «Iimike erganjo iso'ni haaso'een» hine. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yessuusinna hiyye hiisee qici, «Kunni hafuur dageeki anxete kadebaang ha'nooxxeeten; <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />tenne butta'a murte murendaxxi yanna ta'aten; tenne butta duuchiki galchanji ta'a gadhi'a hunemaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Yaane kinni Ani buttii'ni iimi'a shikki shikki hiyyanno wodda manjo duuchcha ifiba'a shiqishanno.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Isinna tenee haaso'echchi hitta hexxeexxe reyonn isi reya'neexxa ege'nisho'atemman. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ardikinna iso'o, « ‹No'oqqa, Kiristoosi duuchchi woddi'a hedha'neexxa seerakena'ni lanqeenen› yoona ati knn hita ‹Manjiink Belti iimi'a shikki shikki hiyya hasissaan› hitatto? Isi kunni Manjiinki Belti ayyete?» hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Far. 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa. 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hiz. 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan. 7:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi hiyye insa'ne'ni haaso'ee qici, «Ta'inni edi'a shiixxooxxe yannaa ifi ha'no'n hedheen; dukkanatinna ha'no'ni daggebaang ifi ha'no'aa hedhee'naanni mammaremme! Dukkanate'ni maremaak isi habaa me'a'neexxa ege'nabaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ha'noo ifiinxe oose kaddinaashaa: ifi ha'no'aa hedhe'naanni konne ifa'ni amanne!» hiyye. Yessuusi tenne haaso'echchi uduma insa'nenaa'ni gargar higee ifi sho'e.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihudiinxa Amana Gopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Yessuusi konne mambe'iinka beessisuwwa duuchcha insa'ne edo assoolenna midde insa'ne iso'ni amanneban. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Tinninna wabeekkichchi Issayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Gootta dhugaa kula no'oxxa ayyeteta amane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Goottiinxi hirre ayyi'a leelltee?» hiyye haaso'emmak hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Tennexxe insa'ne amana dandeennebaan; tinninna wabeekkichchi Issayaasi wele bakka'ni hiyye haaso'ee qici,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ille insa'nexxa balla'ake asseen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">qalbe insa'nexxanna jabeessen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Tennexxee insa'ne ille ifixxenni uundabaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">qalbe ifixxe'ninna galche'nabaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Ani insa'ne'e fayyisab'noshsha insa'ne hingabaan.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa. 6:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Issayaasinna tenne hiyyeek Yessuusika ulfinna isi uudemmaxxeten tennee isixxee haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Tinni kaddoolenna Ayihudinke sooresuwwi giddi'ni midde gateebaang heddi manni Yessuusi'ni amane; yaane kinn Feerisito Muuseka seera barantammake minenaa'n insa'nee fulchinabaashsha sodaantemmaxxee insa'ne iso'ni amanneexxa farri assine kullammabaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Tinninna kaddeechchi insa'ne Magenokenaa'n kadeeke ulfinni irra manjokenaa'n kadeeke ulfinna eenemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Yessuusi hafuura gikki asseexxi hiyyee qici, «Ayyinna ane'n amanoole ane'ni calla kadebaang anee ergemmake'ninna amaneeken: <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Aneenna uudaaki isi anee ergekanna uudaan. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ane'ni amanaak dukkanate'ni hedhabaashsha ifake kade'e kaba butta duuchibaa dagenneni.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />«Hiyyichcho Anka laqeexxi heqqedhabaake'ni murte uwwannok Antebaan. Ani kaba butta duuchchika manna anjironnaa dagenne malee kaba butta duuchcha'n muronaa dagebo'non. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Anee adhdhabaake'ninna hiyyichcho Anka tuffataake manjo'ni muraake hedheen; Ani haaso'annok hiyyichchi umi isingininn udumixxe barra baro iso'ni muraan; <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />tinninna kaddeechchi Ani ifike baalominni haaso'ebo'no ani hiyyanexxanna haaso'annoxxa ajaja uwweeki anee ergeeke Aabiten. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Isik ajaji duuchchi woddixxe hedho kadeexxa egenneennen. Tennexxe Ani haaso'annoxxi duuchcha Aabi ane'ni kuleexxe haaso'annen.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Ifixxe Hordofeeyyexxa Lekka Anshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Yannatinna sa'atike ayyaani edi darre; Yessuusinna tenne butta duuchchanaa'ni Aabibaa me'aaxxi yanna gelteexxa ege'nee. Butta duuchcha'n hedhemmakaara, ifike assedheemakaara eeyye; duuchchi woddixxe jaalalanni insa'ne eeyye.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Insa'nenna hashshixxa ita inda'neege'ni; daabiloosi Simi'oonik belti Asiqorootuk Yihuda Yessuusii sa'isse uwwaashsha qalbe isixxe'ni fuggoka yaada ugge. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yessuusinna, Aabi baallooma duuchcha isi'a uwweexxa isinna Mageniinbaa'ni dageexxanna iittanni Mageniinbaa me'aaxxa ege'neemman. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Tennexxee isi itatenaa'n ke'eexxi hana odo'weemmaxxa seemma butta ugge; hidhake'ninna fooxa usudhdhe. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isi qorete'n wode'e ibiseexxi ifixxe hordofeeyyexxa lekka ansha'n hidhake'n usudhdheemmake fooxinni fiyate'n ke'e.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yessuusinna Simi'ooni Pheexiroosibaa dagee wodda Pheexxiroosinna, «Anke Gootta ati anxa lekka anshittatto?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yessuusinna, «Ati ani assaannexxa ta'a egendebexxon: uduma kinn kassi hittatton» hiyye hiise haasoe'e.<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pheexiroosinna, «Waawwo'o, haranga duuchchi woddi'a lekka anxa ati anishitabexxoni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yessuusinna, «Ani lekka atixxa ansha gophonnole ati aninni welti mittooma affeebexxon» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna «Anke Gootta yoona iittate kaddeexxinni lekka calla kadebaaki anga anxanna umo ankanna anshi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yessuusinna, «biso anshedheeke manji'a hassissaaxxi lekka ifixxa calla anshadjate; gateeki isik bisi duuchchi kinni ca'ichchaken. Ha'noona ca'ichchaken; yaane kinn ha'no duuchchiingi ca'ichchakebaani» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yessuusinna, «Ha'no duuchchiingi ca'ichchakebaani» hiyyeechchi isoo sa'isseexxi uwwaaki ayyete kadeexxa ege'nemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Isi lekka insa'nexxa ansheechchi uduma, seemma oddo'we ifike booncho'n hige ofo'leexxi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ha'no'a assennexxa qalbefatina'nee? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ha'no anee, ‹Barachchiisallokenna Goottake› hitina'neen; ani bariachchiisallokenna Goottake kadennaxxee iitta hiyya ha'nooxxi dhugaaten. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Yoona, ani ha'nooke Goottanna barachchiisalloke kadeennexxi lekka ha'noxxa anshennexxenni ha'noonna iittanni weli'ani weli lekka ha'nooxxa ansha hassissaan. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ani ha'no'a assenneshshanni, ha'noonna iittanni assitinaashsha fakkeenna ha'no'a uwweenneni. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen; garbichchi ifike goottanaa'ni sa'abaan; erganjikinna iso ergaemmakenaa'ni sa'abaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Far. 41:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Yoona ha'no tennee yaane egendineexxi assitinoole eebbisendinaan.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Sa'isseme Uwwemaaxxa Edise Haaso'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«Ani tennee haaso'annechchi ha'noo duuchchingeetebaani; ani fileenneekara ani ege'neennen. Yaane kinn ‹Budeena anka aniinni iteengi naaphummati ane'ni ke'e› hiyyaki Maxaafiinki hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Tinni kaddaa wodda ante kadenneexxa amandinaashsha tinni kadebaang ediseenni ta'a ha'no'ni kuleenneni. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen; ani ergenneka adhdhaak anee adhdhaan; anee adhdhaakinna anee ergeeka adhdhaan.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat. 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luq. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yessuusi tennee hiyyeechchi uduma yaadik akkateexxi «Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen, ha'no giddii'n mitti anee sa'isseexxi uwwaan» hiyya'n farri asse haasso'e. <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Isixxi hordofeeyyenna isi tennee ayyixxee haaso'eexaa ege'na gophat mekki hiteexxe weli'aanni weli uudde. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Insa'ne giddii'n, mitti Yessuusi eeyyammaak, hordofalli Yessuusixxe qoma bira ofo'leemman. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna konne hordofallo qipheexxi «Ayixxee haaso'eexxa isoo qori!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Isinna Yessuusixxe qomabaa cillaaqeexxi «Goottaa! Ayyeete isi?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yessuusinna «Ani konnee ga'masuma buddeena qore giddo bookkennexxi iso'n uwwannoke manjon» hiyye. Iitta hiyyeechchi uduma buddena qore giddo bookkeexxi Simi'oonike belto'n Asiqorootuke Yihuda'n uwwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yihuda buddeena adhdheenge hirba'ni durriisi iso'ni e'ye. Yessuusinna Yihudaa «Assitaattexxa rakkettexxi assi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Kaddo malee Yessuusi mayee iso iitta hiyyeexxa ayyinna ege'nemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yihuda maallaqa abida'neeke kadeemmaxxee mitte mitte hordofeeyye ayyaanake hasisaachcho no'aa hiro'a yookaani hiyyeeyyetee maallaqa uwwo'a Yessuusi haaso'eechcho insa'ne'n labbeemman. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yihudanna ookkonee ga'masuma buddeena adhdheeshshanni fule me'e; yannatinna hashshatemman.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haaroka Ajaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yihuda fuleechchi uduma Yessuusi hiyyee qici, «Ta'a Manjiink Belti ulfaate; iso'ninna Mageni ulfaate. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Yooni Mageni iso'n ulfatoole, Magenikinna Belto ifika ifike umininni lummisaan; isinna iikki woddi isoo ulfeesaan.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />«Anxe oose, ani ha'noonni welti turaanneki heenooxxe yanna'aten; ha'noonna anee hassinaani; Ayihudiinke baalloomiinke manna'n ‹Ani me'anobaa ha'noo dagae dandeetinabaani› hiyyennashshanni, ta'anna ha'no'n tennende lebe hiyyaannen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yoh. 7:34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />«Ani ha'no'n haarooka ajaja uwwaannen; kunninna ha'no weli'aanni weli eetino'aate; yoona ani ha'noo eeyyennashshann ha'noonna weli weli eeyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yoh. 15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoh. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yoh. 5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ha'no welinn weli eetineexxe kaddoole hordofeeyye anxe kaddineexxa manni duuchchi tenne'ni ege'naan.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Pheexiroosi Isoo Waakkataaxxa Ediseenni Kule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luq. 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna Yessuusii'i, «Gootta ati habaate me'itaatteki?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yessuusinna iso'n, «Ani me'aannobaa ta'a ati hordofa dandeettabexxoni yaane kinni uduma anee hordofatton» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pheexiroosinna iso'n, «Goottaa mayee ta'a atee hordofa dande'a gophanno? Ani atixxe buuto'a lubbo anxanna kaddoole midde ati'a sa'isse uwwannon» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yessuusinna iso'n, «Ati dhugaandinn anxe buuto'a lubbo atixxa ani'a sa'issitee uutatto? Ani dhugaate ate'n hiyyaannen; lukkichchi baroodebaa edi darre sasele anee waakkattatton!» hiyye hiise haasoe'e.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Hordofeeyye Ifixxa Jajjabeesse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />«Qalbe ha'nooxi yaaddoqqe'e! Magenoke'n amanne; ane'ninna amanne. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Anke annike mine'ni heddi hedhati mini hedheen; sila iitta kada gophpheele, ‹Ani ha'no'a booncho giissonaa me'annoni› hiyyannabaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ta'a Ani marennexxi booncho ha'no'a giissenechchi uduma Ani hedhennebaa ha'nonna hexxinaashsha langaxxa hige dagannoni anibaanna ha'noo aadhannon. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ani me'annoke boonchibanna geesisaaka ora ha'no egendine'een.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aabiba Geesisaaka Ora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toomaasi isoo hiyyee qici, «Gootta; ati habaa me'itaateexxa no'o egennebe'no yoona ookkone ora hittata ege'na dandeennanno?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yessuusinna iso'n, «Orii, dhugaatinna hedho Anten. Ani darre'nite malee Aabiba'a dagaaki hedhebaan» hiyye hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />«Ha'no anee egendineele Anna ankanna sila egendinnamman. Ha'noo isoo uuddineemmaxxee ta'anni edi'a yoona isoo egendinaan.» <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filiphoosinna, «Gootta! Aabii no'o'n leellishi! Isoo uudan calli no'oo gelte'een» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yessuusinna hiyyeexxi iso'n hiissee qici, «Koo Philiphphoosii! Konne qico Ani ha'noonn welti hedhene wodda midde ati anee egendebexxoo? Anee uudeek Aabii uude'een; hittata ati, ‹Aabii no'o'n leellishi!› hitaatto? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ani Aabi'ni hedhenneexxa, Aabinna Ane'ni hedheexxa ati amandabexxoo? Aninna ha'no'ni hiyyaannek hiyyichchi baallooma ankennitebaan. Yaane kinni huje duuchcha huja'neeki ane'ni hedheeke Aabiten. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Ani Aabi'ni hedhennashshanni Aabinna Ane'ni hedheexxa ha'no anee amanne: weletinna gattoole ha'no isixxe manbe'iinxe hujexxee anee amanne. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ani dhugaate ha'no'n hiyyaannen; Ane'ni amanaak Ani hujannaxxa huje isinna hujaan. Buutotinna Ani Aabibaa me'aannaxxee isi tennenaa'ni caaldeexxa yaanuwwa hujaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Beltokenaa'ni kexxeexxa Aabi ulfaataashsha ha'no Anke summi kadhattinaaxxa yaane duuchcha Ani ha'no'a assannon. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ha'no feeteexxa yaane anke summinni laqqinoole Ani assannon.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchi Hafuurixxee Uwwendeexxa Addachchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Ha'no anee eetina'noole ajaja anka heqqexxinaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Ani Aabii kadhatannoni: Isinna ha'nonni welti duuchchi wadda hedhaaka wele dayyeessallo ha'no'a uwwaan: <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Isinna dhugaatike Hafuuran: isoonna butta duuchcha uudabaakenna egendebaake kadeemaxxee isoo adhdha dandeettaba'a. Yaane kinni isi ha'noonni welti hedhammaxxeenna iittanni ha'no giddo afemaammaxxee ha'no isoo egendinaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Ani ha'noo hado affebaaxxe ooseshsha qofi waalabe'no. Ani ha'nobaa hige dagannoni. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Shiixxooxxe yanna uduma kaba butta duuchchiki manni anee uudaba'a. Yaane kinn hano anee uuddina. Ani hedhot hedhannoke kadennaxxee ha'noonna hedhoti hexxinaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ani, anke Annake'ni hedhdheennexxa, ha'noonna ane'ni hexxineexxa, Aninna ha'no'ni hedheennexxa eettene barra ha'no egendinaan: <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Anee eeyyaaki ajaja anka adhdheexxi heqqedhaakeni; anee eeyyaakanna Anni anki isoo eeyyaan: Aninna isoo eeyyaannoni; iso'ninna ifi leellshannon.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Asiqorootuke Yihuda kadebaak weli Yihuda iso'n, «Goottaa! Yoona butta duuchchike manna'nite kaddeebaak ati no'o'n leellittatto qici hittatee?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yessuusinna iso'n hiyyee qici, «Anee eeyyaaki hedhoole hiyyichcho anka heqqedhaan: Anni ankinna isoo eeyyaan: no'o isibaa dangannon; isinni weltinna he'nannoni. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Anee eeyyabaak hiyyichcho anka heqqedhabaan. Kunni ha'no laqqina'neek hiyyichchi anee ergeemmake Aabike malee ankebaan.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«Ani ta'a ha'noonni welti hedhennaxxee tennee ha'no'n kuleennen. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Aabi anke summinni ergaak dayyeessalli Woyyichchi Hafuur kinni duuchchiinxa yaane ha'no'n barachchiisaan; isi ani ha'noo'ni kulennexxa duuchcha kassi hitinaashsha assaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Aninna nage'a ha'no'a waalannon: nage'a ankanna ha'no'a uwwannon. Ani ha'no'a uwwannok nage'i kaba butta duuchchike nage'ishatebaan. Qalbe ha'nooxxi, yaadoqqe'e, iittanni sodaattoqqe'e.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />« ‹Ani me'annon higennexxi ha'nooba dagannon hiyyennexxa ha'no laqqine'een› Ha'no silaa Anee eetine'eele Aabi anee caalammaxxee ani Aabibaa me'a anxe'ni silaa ha'no gammaddinnamman: <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />ha'noo'ni Ani haaso'ennexxi muuxende'naa ha'no amandinaashsha iitti yaane kaddebaang edisee ta'a ha'no'ni kuleennen. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Kaba butta duuchchiki galchalli durriisi dagaammaxxee konnechchi edi'a Ani ha'noon welt lumo qico haaso'abe'non. Isi ani hana mittechchonna assatika baallooma afebaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Yaane kinn ani Aabii eeyyaannexxa, Anni ank anee ajajeexxanna assaannexxa butta duuchcha egendaashshaten.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">«Ke'we ta'a kabaa'ni me'ino.»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Dhugaatike Woyinetike Hiddichchon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Dhugaatik woyinetik hiddichchi Anten; kaasallikinna anke Annan. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Isinna ane'ni hexxee gummissabaaxxa dame duuchcha woxe hunaan; gumma gummissaaxxa dame duuchcha kinni caala gummissaashsha qurquraan. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ani ha'no'a kulenneke hiyyichchonaa'ni kexxeexxa ha'no ta'a ca'ichchaken. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ha'no Ane'ni hedhdhe! Aninna ha'no'ni hedhannon. Dame Woyinetike haqichcho'ni hedha gophphoole qofitti gumma gummisa dandeetabaani; ha'nonna ane'ni hedha gophinole gumma gummisa dandeetinabaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Ani woyinetike hiddichon; ha'nonna damooleten. Huuni manjinna Ane'ni hedheexxe kaddoole Aninna iso'ni hedhonnole isi heddo gumma gummisaan: ha'noo Ani belo mittelchchonna assa dandeettinabann. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ane'ni hedhabaak gadhi'a hunneendeexxi baggammaxxe damooleshshaten; iitta hexxeexxi damoole qoncendeexxi giirate'ni uggendee'e gubattaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ha'no ane'ni hexxinoole ank hiyyichchinna ha'no'ni hedhoole halsitinaaxxa heene yaanenna kadhatte, ha'no'a uwwendaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Heddo gumma gummisati anxe hordofeeyye kaddineexxa leellishshinoole tenne'ni anki Anni ulfataan.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />«Aabi anee eeyyemmashshanni Aninna ha'noo eeyyaannen. Ta'a eeyya anxe'n hedhdhe. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ani anke Annika ajaja heqqedhennexxi eeyya isixxe'n hedhanneshshanni, ha'noonna ajaja anka heqqexxinoole eeyya anxe'ni hexxinaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ani tennee ha'no'n kulennechchi gammashsho anxi ha'noo'n hexxaashshanna gammashsho ha'nooxxi wo'maxxe kaddaashshaten. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ajaji ankinna, Ani ha'noo eeyyanneshshani ha'noonna weli'anni weli eetinaashshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoh. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoh. 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5">Yoh. 5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Manji hedho ifixxa jaaluwwa ifikee sa'isseexxi uwwatenaa'n saxxaaxxi eeyya hexxebaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ani ha'noo ajajenneka ajaja muuxxinoole ha'no Anke jaaluwwan. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ani koneechchinni edi'a ha'no garbake hiyyabe'non; garbi gootti ifik hujaachcho ege'nebaan. Yaane kinni Ani anke Anninaa'n laqennexxa duuchcha ha'noo'n kuleennaxxee Ani ha'noo jaaluwwa anke hiyyeennen. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ante ha'noo fi'lenne malee ha'no Anee fi'ltinebaan; ha'no me'itinaashshanna gumma gummissinaashsha gumma ha'nooxxinna hexxaashsha ha'noo baalloonseennen. Tennexxee Aabi ha'noo summi ankenni kadhatinaaxxa duuchcha ha'no'a uwwaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ajaji ankinna ha'no weli'anni weli eetinaashshateni.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaba Buttik Manni Hordofeeyye Gibaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Butta duuchchiki manni ha'noo giboole ha'no edi darre anee gibeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ha'no kaba butta duuchchike kaddine'eele butta duuchchik manni ifike assedheexxi ha'noo eeyyamman. Yaane kinni Ani butta duuchchike manninaa'n gargari asse ha'noo fi'lennaxxee ha'no buttatike mannabaan; butta duuchcha ha'no gibbaachchi tennexxeeten. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />‹Garbi gootta ifikenaa'n sa'abaan› hiyyeennexxi Ani ha'no'ni kulennaxxa kassi hiyye. Anee shorrine'eexxe kaddoole ha'noonna shorrinaan. Insa'ne hiyyichcho anka heqe'ne'eexxe kaddoole hiyyichcho ha'nookanna heqqe'naan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat. 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luq. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh. 13:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Insa'ne anee ergeeka ege'na gonphemmaxxee, anke summixxe daafe'a tennee duuchcha ha'no'n assinaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ani dagennexxi insa'ne'n kula gopheennele silaa insa'ne'n cubbote kaddammabaan; Ta'a kinn insa'nexxe cubboxxe daafe'a aallantaachchi hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Anee gibaaka anki Anninna isoo gibaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Weli manji hujabaaxxa huje insa'nexxe oddo'n Ani huja gophenneele silaa insa'ne'a cubbote kaddammabaan. Yaane kinni ta'a insa'ne konne manbe'uwwa uunde'een: kaddo malee insa'ne aneenna Anna ankanna jibbine'een. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Tinninna kaddeechchi, ‹Insa'nenna tolanga anee jibbineen› hiyyendeexxi seera insa'neke'ni borreessendeexxi muuxendaashshaten.<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Ani Aabibaa'ni ha'no'a ergannok, Aabinaa'ni ha'no'a ergemaak dayyeessaalli dhugaatik Hafuuri dagaa wodda Isi anxee dhugaa kulaan. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ha'noonna kinni sirendenaa'ni aninni welti hexxinneemmaxxee dhugaa kuldinaan.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Higgeenni Yessuusi hiyyee qici, «Ani tenne duuchcha ha'no'n kulennechchi ha'noo amana ha'nooxxa waaldinabaashsha hiyyeeten. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Insa'ne Muuseka seera barantammake minenaa'n ha'noo fulchinaan; ha'no shiyaak manni duuchchi isi Magenokee ergatema'neeke labbaaxxi yanna daggaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Insa'ne tenne duuchchanna ha'no'ni assinaachchi Aabii yookaan anee ege'na gonphemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ani tennee ha'no'n edise kulenneechchi yanna iitti geltaa wodda ha'no qaabbatino'a hiyyeeten. Aninna ha'nonni welit hedhennaxxee tennee edisennexxi ha'no'ni kulebe'no.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchi Hafuurixxa Huje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />«Ta'a yoona anee ergemmake Annibaa me'aannen: kaddo malee ha'no giddii'ni, ‹Me'itaatebi habaate?› hiyyeexxi anee qoraak manji hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Yaane kinni ani tennee haaso'ennaxxee qalbe ha'nooxxe'n yaaddo wo'mite'een. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Yaane kinni Ani dhugaate ha'no'a hiyyaannen: me'a Anxi ha'no'a eloxxen. Ani me'a gophonnole dayyeessalli ha'nobaa dagabaan; Ani me'onnole kinni isoo ha'nobaa ergannon: <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Isi dagaa wodda butta duuchcha cubbotixxee, qullumatixxeenna murtetixxee kokeessaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Cubbotixxee hiyyaa manni Ane'ni amana gophammaxxeeten: <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Qullumatixxe'e ani Aabibaa me'annaxxeenna ha'no ta'anni edi'a Anee uuda gophphinammaxxeeten: <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />murtetixxeenna, kaba butta duuchchike galchallo'ni murte murendemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Ani ha'noo'ni kulaannexxi heddo yaane hexxemman: ta'a kinn ha'noo'n ha'ura ha'urtaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Yaane kinni dhugaatik Hafuur dagaa wodda dhugaatibaa ha'noo akeekaan. Isi umo ifikenaa'ni haaso'abaan: isi laqemmanxe calla haaso'aan: iittanni isi edi'a kaddaaxxa ha'noo'ni kulaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Isi anxe kaddeexxa yaane anenaa'ni aadheexxi ha'noo'ni kulaammaxxee anee ulfeessaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Aabike kedeechchi duuchchi anken; yoona ‹Iikki Hafuur Anke kadeechonaa'ni aadheexxi ha'noo'n kulaan› hiyyeenneehchi tennexxeeten.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Lebeexxi Yessuusi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Shiixxoxxe yanna uduma anee uudinabaan: kaddo malee shiixxoxxe yanna uduma higgeenni anee uuddinaan.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hordofeeyyetixxi Yaaddo Gammashshotibaa Jijjiirendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Hordofeeyye isixxi giddii'ni mitte mitte weli'aanni weli, «Shiixxoxxe yanna uduma anee uudinabaan; kaddo malee ‹Shiixxoxxe yanna uduma higgeenni anee uudinaan› iittanni ‹Ani Aabibaa me'annaxxee› hiyya isixxi maa hiyyote?» hite. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Insa'nenna, «Shiixoxxa yanna hiyya isixxi maa hiyyote? Isi hiyya'neexxi yaane no'o'ni aaggebaan» hina'ni weli'aanni weli hiisine hiisinee qorra'nemman.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yessuusinna isoo qorro'a hanseexxa ege'neexxi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ha'no weli'anni weli qortina'neechchi ‹Shiixxoxxe yanna uduma anee uuddinabaan; kaddo malee shiixxoxxe yanna uduma higgeenni anee uuddinaan› hiyyennexxeete? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ani dhugaate ha'noo'n hiyyaannen ha'no yaadinaani; ooxxinaan; kaba butta duuchchik manni kinni gammadaan. Kaddo malee yaaddo ha'nooxxi gammashshotibaa jijjiirendaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Meyyaxxi ildaa wodda ciniintotixxi isexxi barra gelteemmaxxee yaaddaani; yaane kinn ise ildeechchi uduma anno kaba butti'a daggeemmaxxee, ise gammashshotixxe bira sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa ciniintoti woddixxa rakko deetaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ha'noo'aanna iittanni ta'i yaaddotixxe yannan; kaddo malee Ani higgeenni ha'noo uuddaannaxxee gammaddinaan; gammashsho ha'noxxanna ha'nonaa'ni aadhdhaaki hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Eettene barra ha'no anenaa'ni mittechchonna kadhattinabaan. Ani dhugaate ha'no'a hiyyaannen: Aabi anke summinni kadhatinaaxxa duuchcha ha'no'a uwwaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ta'i qico'ni ha'no anke summinni mittechchonna kadhattinebaan: gammashsho ha'noxxi wo'mate kaddaashsha kadhatte! Adhdhitinaan.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Ani tenne ha'noo'ni mammaassiki haaso'ennen: ta'inni edi'a mammaassik haaso'abe'noxxe yanna daggaan; yaane kinn Aabixxee duuchchiinxa yaane farri asseennexxi ha'no'n kulannon. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Eettene barra ha'no anke summinni kadhattinaan; yaane kinn Ani ha'nooxxa bakka Aabii'i kadhatannoni hiyyatebaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ha'noo anee eetine'eemmaxxeenna Ani Mageniinbaa'n dagennexxa ha'no amandine'eemmaxxee Aabi umo ifingenninni ha'noo eeyyaan. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ani Aabibaa'ni fuleennexxi kaba butta duuchchibaa dageennen; ta'a kinni Ani tennee butta duuchcha waaleennexxi Aabibaa me'annon.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hordofeeyyetinna isoo hitee qici, «Ta'a reefi ati farri assite mammassi belo haasottette. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Ta'a no'o ati duuchchiinxa yaane egendetexxanna ayyinna atee qora hasissabaaxxa egeneennen. Tennexxee no'o ati Mageniinbaa'ni daggetexxa amanneennen» hine. <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiisseexxi hiyyee qici, «Ta'a ha'noo amandineen hiyyatee?» <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Yoona mitti mitti ha'nongi ifi ifinge minibaa xexxeeredinaaxe yanna daggaan; iitti yannanna ta'aten. Ha'no Anee qofitti waaldinaan; kaddo malee Anni anki aninni welti hedhemmaxxee ani qofi hedhebe'non. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />«Aninna tennee ha'no'n haaso'eennek ha'no ane'ni hexxineexxi nage'a alfitinaashsha hiyyeeten. Ha'no kaba butta duuchcha'n hexxina'nee qico'ni rakkote affine'een. Yaane kinn ha'no mee co'o! Ani tennee butta duuchcha injifateennen.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Ifike Umixxee Soodateexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yessuusinna tennee haaso'eechchi uduma iimi'a toggi hiyyeexxi soodatee qici:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">«Ee, Anna ta'a yanna gelte'een. Belti atik atee ulfessaashsha Belto atika ulfeessi! <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ati isoo ulfessitatechchinna isi'a ati uutetteke manni duuchchi'a duuchchi woddixxa hedho isi uwwaashshanna manni duuchchi isike baalloomi hunda hedhaashsha utettexxeen. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Dhugaatike Mageno kaddeeteka atenna ati ergiteeteka Yessuusi Kiristoosii'i egennaashsha tinni duuchchi woddixxe hedhon. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ati Ani'a uutettexxa huje birennexxi kaba butta atee ulfessennen. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ee, Annayyoo! Butta dadendebaa edi darre ani atinni welti afeennake ulfinninni ati Anee uulfeessi.»<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Hordofeeyye Ifixxee Soodate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />«Konne kaba butta duuchchinaa'n fildetexxi Ani'a uutetteke manna'n ayyumma atixxa ani leellisheennen. Insa'nenna atikeeramman; ati insa'nee Ani'a uuteten; insa'nenna hiyyichcho atika heqqe'ne'een. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Ani'a uutettelchchi duuchchi atiba'nite kaddeexxa ta'a insa'ne egene'een. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Ani'a uutetteka hiyyichcho insa'ne'a Ani uwwe'naa insa'nenna adhdhineen: Aninna atibaa'ni dagennexxanna dhugaandiinni insa'ne egenenneen: ati anee ergitetteexxa insa'ne amanneen. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Insa'ne atike kandeemmaxxee Ani insa'neexxe soodataanne; yaane kinni ati ani'a uutetekeenna atike kadeeke malee ani buttatee soodatabe'non. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Aniichcho kadeechi duuchchi atiken: atike kadeki duuchchinna anken: aninna insa'nenni ulfaatennen. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Yoona Ani kaba butta duuchcha'n turaabo'non: insa'ne kinn kaba buttanni he'neen: Ani atiba dagaanen. Ee, Woyyichcha Annayyoo, konni ani'a uteteekiir no'oshshanni insa'ne mitteke kandaashsha summa atikenni insa'nee heqqi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ani insa'nenni welti hedhenna wodda, Ani'a uuteetteke summinni insa'ee golleennen; heqqeennen: Maxaafiinki hiyyichchi muuxemaashsha ookkonee ba'aka belto malee insa'nenaa'ni mittikinna ba'ebaan.»<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />«Ani taa atibaa dagaannen: yaane kinn gammashsho Anxi insa'ne'n wo'mitaashsha, ta'a buttande'n hedheennexxi Ani tennee haaso'aanneni. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ani hiyyichcho atika insa'ne'n uwweenneni; Ani kaba butta duuchchike kada gopheenneshshanni insa'nenna kaba butta duuchike kada gompheemmaxxee butta duuchchik manni insa'nee gibe'een. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Ani atee soodataannechchi fuggoxxenaa'n insa'nee heqqitotta'ate mallee: butta duuchchanaa'n insa'ne fulchitottatebaan. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ani kaba butta duuchanaa'nite kada gophenneshshanni insa'nenna kaba butta duuchchanaa'nitebaan. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Hiyyichchi atik dhugaaten: dhugaa atixxenni insa'nee woyyoonsi <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ati butta duuchchike mannibaa Anee ergitetteshshanni Aninna insa'nee butta duuchchike mannibaa ergeennen. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Insa'ne dhugaati woyyoolete kandaashsha ani umo anka insa'nexxee woyyoonseenneni.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi, Amaneeke Duuchchi'a Soodate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Insa'nexxa barachcho adheexxi Ane'ni amanaakeeri'anna soodataane malee'e konneri'a calli'a soodataabe'no; <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />tinninna Ee, Annayyoo, ati ane'ni, Aninna ate'ni hedhenneshshanni duuchchiing mitteke kandaashsha, iittanni ati anee ergitettexxa butta duuchchik manni amanaashsha, insa'nenna no'o'ni he'naashshaten. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />No'o mitteke kandeenneshshanni insa'nenna mitteke kandaashsha ati Ani'a uutettaka ulfinna insa'ne'a uwwe'eennen. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Tinninna Ani insa'ne'ni, atinna Ane'ni hedhaten. Ati Anee ergitettexxanna anee eetettexxe qixxe'ni insa'neenna ati eete'eettexxa kaba butta duuchchiki manni ege'naashsha, mittoomi insa'neki haranga gargar higebaake kadowwaal.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«Ee, Annayyoo! Kunni Ani'a uutettekiiri ani hedhenneba insa'ne he'naashsha, butta dadendebaang anee eeteettaxxee ati ani'a uutetteka ulfinna insa'ne uundaashsha hasaannen.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />«Qullchcha Annaa, buttatik manni atee ege'na gophphoolenna Ani atee ege'neennen. Insa'nenna ati anee ergitettexxa egenne'een. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ati ani'a affeettexxi eeyya insa'ne'ni hexxaashsha, Aninna insa'ne'ni hedhannoshsha, insa'ne atee egennaashsha asse'eenneni; edi'anna atee egennaashsha assannon.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Sa'isseeme Uwweemeexxana Abideemeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luq. 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yessuusi soodachcho muuxeechchi uduma ifixxe hordofeeyyenni welti hedheexxi Qediroonixxe dhooqabaa widi'a me'e; isinna hordofeeyye isixxenni welti ookko hedhemmake hiddichchiinke fichchi giddi'a e'ye. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Heddo yanna Yessuusi hordofeeyye ifixxenni welti ookko afemaammaxxee isoo sa'isseexxi uwweemak Yihuda ookkone booncho ege'neeman. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yihudanna loliinka manna iittanni qeesetika sooreessanna Feerisitotibaa'ni ergemeeka Woyyichchi galmika heqqanjuwwa isi edo hedhe akeeka'ni ookkone hiddichchuwwiinke fichchibaa dage. Insa'nenna xassa, faanosenna loliinka miya abixxineemman.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yessuusinna iso'ni gelta'neexxa duuchcha ege'ne fuleexxi insa'nee, «Ha'no hassina'neek ayyete?» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Insa'nenna isoo, «Naazireetike Yessuusi hansaannen» hine. Yessuusinna insa'ne'n, «Anten» hiyye. Sa'isseexxi uwwammak Yihuda insa'nenn welit uurreemman. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'ni, «Anten» hiyye wodda insa'nenna udumi'a shikki shikki hineexxi buttinake'n inbe.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Higgeenni Yessuusi insa'nee, «Ha'no hassina'neek ayyete?» hiyye qore. Insa'nenna iso'ni, «Naazireetike Yessuusi hansaannen» hine.<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yessuusinna insa'ne'n hiisseexxi, «Ha'no'n, Anten hiyyeennen; Ha'no Anee hassina'neexxe kaddoole, me'inuun insa'nee waalle» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Tinninna kaddeechchi isi, «Konne Ati ani'a uutetteeke manni giddii'ni mittikinna midde Anenaa'ni ba'ebaan» hiyyeeki hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Wolaantichcha abixxemmak Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna wolaantichcha golsheexxi qeesetike soorersike erganjixxa middixxa mansha woxe. Ookkone erganjik summinna Malkoositemman.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yessuusinna Pheexiroosii'i, «Wolaantichcha atika gonofi giddi'a hiissi! Aabi ani'a uwwaaxxa rakkotixxa buuda Ani ha'wabe'nota?» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat. 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luq. 22:42</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusii Umo Qeesichcho Haanna Edo shiqeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ookkonneechi uduma loliinki mann insa'nek ajajallinninna Ayihudiinke heqanjuwwinni welti Yessuusii'i abinde usureexxi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Edinseexxi isoo Haanna hiyyemaake manjichchibaa iyyemarre. Eettene wogga'n Haanna umo qeesichcho kadeemmake Qeyyaafa'a ballokemman. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Qeyyaafanna, «Mitti manji ardakee hiyyeexxi reyole woyyan» hiyyeexxi Ayihuda gorseemmake manjomman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Yoh. 11:49-50</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pheexxiroosoi Yessuusii Waakkateexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat. 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar. 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luq. 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna mitti weli hordofalli Yessuusii hordonfe. Iikki weli hordofallinna ookkone umo qeesichcho'n ege'nemeeke kade'eemmaxxee isi Yessuusinni welti ookkone umo qeesichchike dalla'i giddi'a e'ye; <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Pheexiroosi kinn hulati gadho uureemman. Qeesetike akeekisanjo'ni ege'nemeeki iikki weli hordofallinna udumi'a hige'e hula heqqitammaxxa yaansiseexxi Pheexiroosii aadhe e'ye.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Iitti hula heqqitammaxxi dubarrichcho Pheexiroosii, «Konne manjichchixxe hordofeeyye giddii'ni mitti atetebaa?» hite. Isinna, «Waawwoti» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Iitti yannanna boojjetixxe kaddemmaxxee ergatemaammak manninna hula heqqammakiiri giira ha'ishee uurreexxi guba'laa'naa'a, Pheexiroosinna insa'nenni welti uurree giira guba'laamman.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Umi Qeesichchi Edo Shiqeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luq. 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ookkone wodda umi qeesichchi Yessusii'i isixxe hordofeeyyexxeenna isi barachchiisaammaxxe barachchoxxee qore. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yessuusinna iso'n hiyyeexxi hiissee qici, «Ani kaba butta duuchchike manna'n farri assee haaso'eennen; Ayihudi duuchchi bukki hiyyeexxi Muuseka seera baratammaba, woyyichchi galmi giddo duuchchi wodda ani barachchiiseennen. Ani sho'ik haaso'enechchi hedhebaan. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Mayeete ati anee qortaattechchi? Haaso'aa'naa leqemmaka manna qori! Yoona Ani haaso'eennexxa insa'ne egennaan.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yessuusinna tennee haaso'ee wodda, ookko isi bira uureemmake hula heqqammakerinaa'n mitti, «Umo qeesichcho'n iitta hiissitee haasotatto?» hiyyerxxi isoo kabale. <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yessuusinna isoo, «Ani fuggoxxa haso'oonnole fuggoxxe haasotteetteni hiteetexxi ku'li. Dhugaa haaso'oonnole kinni mayee Anee gandatto?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ookkoneechchi udum Haanna Yessuusi usureemeeshshanni hedhee'naa umo qeesichcho Qeyyaafaba'a erge.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pheexiroosi Yessusi'i Higgeeni Waakkate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat. 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar. 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luq. 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Eettene yanna'ni Simi'ooni pheexiroosi uurreexxi giira guba'la'neenge'ni weli manni isoo, «Ati hordofeeyye isixxi giddii'ni mitti atetebaa?» hiyye. Isinna hiisseexxi, «Waawwoti» hiyye waakkate. <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umi qeesichchi'a ergataammake manni giddii'ni mitti Pheexiroosi mansha woxemmake manjichchike fira kadeek isoo, «Hiddichuwwiinke fichchike booncho'ni Ani atee isinni welti uudeennabaa?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Higgeeni Pheexiroosi waakkate; hirba ookkone'ninni lukko baroodde.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Philaaxoosi edo Shiqe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luq. 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ayihuudooti Yessuusii Qeyyaafabaa'n Roomike bogike galchallike dalla'i giddi'a adhdhe me'e. Yannatinna gorsa bariisatemman. Ayihudikinna sa'atike ayyannika beltanjo ita hasissammaxxee iteexxi batto'abaashsha galchaliinke dalla'i giddi'a e'yebaan. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Tennexxee Philaaxoosi insa'neba'a gadhi'a fuleexxi, «Ha'no konne manjichcho ku'litina'neechchi maacho?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Insa'nenna iso'n, «Kunni manjichchi balleesa afa gopheechcho kaddeele sila no'o ati edo shiqinshannabaan» hineexxi hiisine haasonne. <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Philaaxoosinna insa'nen, «Ha'no umo ha'noogeenninni isoo adhdhitine me'itineexxi ha'nooke seerishshanni iso'ni murre» hiyye. Ayihudikinna isoo, «No'o ayye'ninna reyotixxa murte murratee seera anfebe'non» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Tinni kaddeechchi Yessuusi hitta hexxeexxe reyonni reyaaxxa isi umo ifingenninni haaso'eemmak hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoh. 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Philaaxoosi dalla'i giddi'a e'ye; Yessuusiinna ye'iseexxi, «Ati Ayihudiinke moyanjoo?» hiyye isoo qore. <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yessuusinna, «Kunni yaadi ati ifi'aanni hitaattekemo'o? Yookaan weli manni anxee ate'ni kuleeke?» hiyyeexxi hiisse haasoe'e. <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Philaaxoosinna iso'n, «Ani Ayihudichchokeeta? Atee anibaa ergeeki atinge firanna umo qeesen. Ati maacho balleesitete?» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yessuusinna isoo hiisseexxi, «Anxi mootumma tenne buttaxxebaan; iitta kaddeele Ayihudi anee abidabaashsha erganjuwwi ank ani'a lolamman. Yeene kinni anxi mootumma tenne buttaxxebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Philaaxoosinna isoo «Yoona Ati moyanjoke hiyyotebaataa!» hiyye. Yessuusinna, «Ani moyanjoke kadennexxa ati hiteettexxi dhugaaten: Ani ilemennechchi, kaba butta dagenechchi dhugaatixxee kulonnaaten; dhugaatenaa'ni kadeek duuchchi ani hiyyennexxa laqaan» hiyyeexxi hiise haaso'e. <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Philaaxoosinna, «Dhugaa isii maachcho?» hiyye. Isinna tennee haaso'echchi uduma higgeenni Ayihudiinbaa mareexxi insa'nee hiyyee qici, «Ani iso'ni mitte balleessanna afebe'no: <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />yaane kinn ha'no sa'atike ayyaana'ni mitti manji usurrakenaa'ni tikemaaxxa baranno affineen: tennexxee ‹Ayihudiinka moyanjo ha'no'a tikonnaa hassina'nee?› » <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Insa'nenna higgeenni cancina'ni, «Waawwo'o; isotebaan! Berbaanii'i no'aa tiki!» hine. Barbaani kinn shittakemman.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Fannisemaashsha Murte Murende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Mat. 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar. 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Philaaxoosi Yessuusii'i jadhafise. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Loliinki mannina ute mirqe'e kallachcha giisseexxi isike umi hana ugge. Insa'nenna diimmooxxa baddeessitte seemma iso'ni oddesine: <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />insa'nenna isibaa shinqa'ni, «Ayihudiinke moyanjoo! Nage'i ati'a kadowwaal» hina'ne iso'o kaballaamman. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Philaaxoosinna higgeenni gadhi'a fuleexxi insa'ne'n, «Yoona iso'ni mitte balleesanna afebe'noxxa ha'no egendinaashsha isoo ha'no'a gadhi'a fulchaannen» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yessuusi ute mirqinee ookkonee giisineeka kallachcha isike umi hana uggine'naa diimmooxxa baddeessitte seemma oddo'weexxi gadhi'a fule: Philaaxoosinna insa'ne'ni, «Kunuudde! Manjichcho» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Umo qeesenna insa'ne'a ergatemammak manni isoo uude wodda, «Fannis! Fannis!» hiyya'ni cance.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Yaane kinn Philaaxoosinna insa'ne'a hiisseexxi, «Ha'no isoo adhdhitine fannisse: ani darree'ni ani iso'ni ku'latee geesissaaxxa balleessa mittenna iso'ni afebe'non» insa'ne'a hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayihudikinna hiisseexxi, «No'o seerake anfeennen: kunni manjichchi umo ifika Mageniinke Belto assemmaxxee no'oke seerishsha reyote isi'a hasissaan» hine.<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Philaaxoosi tenne laqee wodda lumo qico sodaate: <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />isinna dalla'i giddo higeexxi Yessuusii, «Ati haba'ni daggette?» hiyyeexxi qore: Yessuusi kinn mittechchonn isi'a hiisse'e haaso'ebaan. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Tennexxee Philaaxoosinna isoo, «Haasotabexxo atee tikonnaa yookaan fannisonnaa ani baalle afeennexxa ati egendebexxo?» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yessuusi isoo hiisseexxi, «Iimi'ni ati'a baalloomi uwwema gopheele ati ane'ni baallooma affattabaan. Tennexxee anee sa'issee ate'ni uwweeke manjo'n saxxeexxe cubbo hexxeen» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi'ni Reyotixxi Murte Murendeexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat. 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar. 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luq. 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Philaaxoosi Yessusii tike wocci asso'a hase: yaane kinn Ayihudi, «Ati konne manjo tikkoottole ati Qeesaarike jaalobaan: Ifi moyanjoke assaak isi Qeesarike naaphan» hina'ni cancine. <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Philaaxoosi tennee laqee wodda: isi Yessuusii gadhi'a fulcheexxi, Bexxichcha kinjo hiyyemmake Aramayike laagadinni Gebeta hiyyemee ye'emaake booncho'ni murtetixxe moote hana ofo'le. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Barratinna sa'atike ayyaani'a qopheesseccatixxe barramman: yannatinna barrixxe jaane saatebatemman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Ookkone wodda Philaaxoosi Ayihudi, «Kunse! Ha'nook moyanji!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Yaane kinn insa'ne, «Isoo hoyyi! Isoo hoyyi! Iso'o fannisi!» hina'n hoginse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Philaaxoosinna, «Moyanjo ha'nooka ani fannisoo?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Umi Qeesenna iso'n, «Qeesaari malee'e weli moyanji no'aa hedhebaan» hite hiissite haassotte. <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Eettene yanna'ni Philaaxoosi isoo fanniso'a sa'iseexxi insa'ne'a uwwe. Loliinki manninna Yessuusii abindeexxi me'ine.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Fannisensha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luq. 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi fanno ifixxa dulkeexxi, Aramayike laagadinni Golgoota hiyyeme ye'ema'neeke booncho'ni, Isinna umiinke qoonjo hiyyemaake boonchibaa me'e. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Insa'nenna isoo okko fanninse; Yessuusii'i oddote'ni uggine isinni welti wele lame manna, mitte middii'ni mitte bita'i'n fanninse. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Philaaxoosinna borro borreesseexxi fannote'ni rarraase: borrotinna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:19">«Naazireetik Yessuusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:19">Ayihudiinka moyanjo» hitaaxxemman.<verse eid="JHN 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yessuusi fanniseme boonchi qachchi bira kademmaxxee heddi Ayihudiink manni giddii'n heddi eettene borro haasesse. Borrotinna borresendemmak Aramayike, laatinetikenna Girkeeke laagadinnitemman. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Yaane kinni Ayihudiinxi umo qeese Philaaxoosii'i, «Ati ‹Yihudinke moyanjon› hite borreessitoxxe'e. Yaane kinni ‹Kunni manjichchi Ani Ayihuudinke moyanjon hiyyeen› hite borreesi» hine. <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Philaaxoosinna, «Ani borreessenexxa borreessennen» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Iikki loliink manni Yessuusii'i fanniseechchi uduma seemma isixxa shooleba qodeexxi umo umo ifikee mitte mitte adhdhe; iittanni eettene angatiba cu'maxxa seemmanna adhdhine; yaane kinni tinni angatiba cu'maxxi seemma darendebaang iimi'ni butti qico'n mitteba hujendeexxemman. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Tennexxee insa'ne weli'aan weli, «Hixa ibisine'naa mitte gelteeke gelto malee darrabe'non» hine. Tinninna kaddeechchi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Seemma anxa qoodemme;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">angatiba cu'maxxe anxe seemma'ninna hixa ibilsineen»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Hiyya'neek maxaafiink hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten. Loliinki manninna tenneenni asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Far. 22:18</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Yessuusixxe fanno bira ama isixxinna, isixxe amaxxi dayyo, iittanni Qeliyoophphaxxi are Maaraminna Megidelixxi Maarami ookko uurrineemman. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yessuusi ama isixxanna isi eeyyammak hordofisanji ifi bira uurrinee'na uude wodda ama ifixxa, «Tee anxe amaa kunse belti atik!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isi hordofisanjokanna, «Kunnuudi ama atixxa!» hiyye; eettene yannanaa'ni ke'iseexxi kunni hordofisanji isee ifike minibaa adhdhe me'e.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luq. 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi ta'a duuchchiinxi yaane muuxendeexxa ege'neexxi: maxaafake'n borreessendeexi yaane muuxendaashsha «Ani dheebo'weennen» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Far. 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ookko majaja'neexxi woyine wo'miteek miyi hedhemman. Tennexxee insa'ne isipoonje woyintike bulbulo'ni cuunpheexxi Hisophi hiyyemaake haqichchinn qaranbee Yessuusike afo'ibaa shiqinse. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yessuusinna eettene majajjaammaxxa woyine maqeechchi uduma, «Yaane muuxendeen» hiyye. Umo ifika hangulli asseexxi ifixxa lubbo sa'isse uwwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusik cinaachchi Bagediki Oteme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Iitti barranna edike sanbati'a qopheesseccatixxe barramman. Ayihudi konnee fannisemeemmake mannik renshi Edike Sanbatixxa barra fannote'n iima hosabaashsha insa'ne hansemmaxxeenna iikki Edik Sanbatinna lumoke ayyaanike Sanbata kademmaxxee fannisemeeke mannixxa lekka enqine'naa rensha fannotenaa'ni dirrinso'a Philaaxoosi'i kadhante. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Tennexxee loliinki mann dageexxi Kirsitoosinni welti fannisememmake siretike manjichchixxa lekka enqine. Langake manjichchixxa lekkanna enqine. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Yaane kinni insa'ne Yessuusibaa dangee wodda isi edise reyeexxa uundemmaxee lekka isixxa enqinebaan. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Yaane kinn loliinki mann giddi'ni mitti Yessuusika cinaachcha bagedik ote: isona'ninna hirbange'ni mundetinna wodi'i duneme. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Tennee uudek manji ifixxa dhugaa kuleen: dhugaa isixxi kulanna dhugaatixxen: isinna dhugaa haaso'a'nexxa ege'neen: isinna ha'no amandinaashsha dhugaa kula'neen. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Tinninna kaddeechchi, «Isike micconaa'ni mitti midde enqemabaan» hiyyemeeki Woyyichchi maxaafik hiyyichchi muuxemaashshaten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 9:12">Lak. 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34">Far. 34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek. 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Wal. 1:7</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Higgeenni wele Woyyichcha maxaafa'ninna «Insa'ne ookkonne ontemmaka uundaan» hiyyammaxxeeten.<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusixxa Moogema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luq. 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Armatiyaasike bogik Yooseefi Yessuusika rensha adhdho'a Philaaxoosii kadhate; Yoosefinna Ayihuda sodaatemmaxxee sho'ik Yessuusii hordofaamman. Isinna Philaaxoosi'i eetii laqeechchi uduma dageexxi ookkone rensha aadhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Konneechchi edo hashsha Yessuusibaa maremmaki Niqodimoosi mitte dhibba leetiro geltaaxxa Karbe Ireeteti welti makeexxi aadhe dage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoh. 3:1-2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Insa'nenna Yessuusika rensha adhdhineexxi Ayihudiinke galdumixxe mirqashsha shitto hana fiffinxeexxi layinotixxe seemmanni mirqine. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Iikki Yessuusi fannisemeek boonchi hiddichchinke fichchamman. Ookkone hiddichchiinke fichcha'ni weli mittikinna moogemebaak haarooki mooggiibi hedhemman. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Iitti barranna Ayihudiinke Edike Sanbatixxe qophefachchotixxe barra kaddemmaxxee mooggi boonchinna shiqate kadeemmaxxee insa'ne Yessuusi ookko moongeen.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Reyotenaa'n Ke'e</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat. 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luq. 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Sanbatiinxa gorsa bariisa boro haachchabbebaang, Megidelixxi Maarami moogginbaa marte: isenna moogoke'ni cunfeemmak kinji goggo'mee'naa uudde. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Tennexxee ise Simi'ooni Pheexiroosibaanna Yessuusi eeyyaammake wele hordofalliba gongita'ni daggeexxi, «Gootta moongemmaxxe balenaa'ni insa'ne fulchinee aadhdhine'een haba uggineexxa egennebe'no» hite kulde.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Pheexiroosinna weli hordofisanj ke'ne moogginbaa me'ine. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Lamiing gongina'nemman: weli hordofisanji kinni Pheexiroosi waale sa'eexxi edise mooggiinba geye. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Isinna heeshshi hiyyeexxi moongemmaxxe bale giddi'a uude wodda mirqineemmaxxi seemma ookko hexxe'naa uude; yaane kinni mooggiinxe bale giddi'a e'yeba'a. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma isoo hordofaammak Simi'ooni Pheexiroosi mare geyeexxi moogiinxe bale giddi'a e'ye: isinna mirqinemmaxxa seemma ookko hexxeenaa uude: <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />iitanni isi Yessuusike umo'ni hana mirqinemmaxxa seemma uude: tinni seemmanna mirqinemmaxxe seemmanaa'ni qofitinn wele booncho'ni mirqendeeshshann hexxe'naa uude. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Iikki edise dageemmak hordofalli; mooggiinxe baleba giddi'a e'ye uudeechchi uduma amane. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Tinninna «Yessuusi royotenaa'ni ke'a hasissaan» hiyyaak Woyyichchi maxaafika hiyyichcho insa'ne kassi hinemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma lamiinxi hordofeeyye mini ifikiba higge me'ite.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Megidelixxe Maarami'n Leelle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat. 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar. 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Yaane kinn Maarami hirreessi gadhi darre uurite ooxxaamman. Isenna ooxxa'ni mooggiinxa bale uuddo'a heeshshi hite. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Yessuusik renshi hedhemma booncho'ni golalooxxa seemma oddo'witeexxi lame erganna mitte lekkatibaa'n, wele umiibaa'n ofolde'naa affe. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Tinni ergannanna ise'n «Tee manjichcho ati mayee ooxxaatte?» hite isee qorte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Isenna, «Gootta anka adhdhine'een; haba isoo uggineexxa ege'nebe'no» hite. <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Isenna tennee hite udumi'a wirri hite wodda Yessuusi ookko uurre'naa affe; yaane kinn ise Yessuusite kadeexxa egendeemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yessuusinna isee, «Tee manjichcho ati mayee ooxxaatte? Ati ayyee hassaatte?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Isenna isi hiddichchiinka fichcha heqqa'neeke manjo ise'ni labee'naa, «Anke gootta, ati adhdhiteettexxe kaddoole maganneteni ani isoo adhdhonnaa ballo'o isoo haba uggiteetexxa Ane'ni kuli» hite.<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yessuusinna isee hiyyee qici, «Maarami!» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Isenna isibaa wirri hiteexxi Aramayike laagadinni, «Rebuuni!» hite; iitta hiyyatinna, «Barachchiisalloo» hiyyaten. <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yessuusinna ise'n, «Ani Aabibaa iimi'a me'a gopheennaxxee anee abidoxxe'e; yaane kinni ati anke dayyuwwiba martettexxi ‹Ani anke Annibaanna ha'noke Annibaa anke Magenibaanna ha'noke Magenibaa iimi'a me'aannen› hiyyeenni hiteettexxi insa'ne'ni kuli!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Megidelixxi Maarami hordofeeyyetibaa daggeexxi «Ani Gootta uudeennen!» hite: isenna insa'ne'ni isi haaso'eexxa kulde.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Ifixxe Hordofeeyye'n Leelleexxa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luq. 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Eettene edike sanbatixxe barraxxa hashsha hordofeeyye Ayihuda soddaatteexxi huluwwa danqarte mini giddo bukki hiteeba, Yessuusi dagee oddo insa'nexxe'ni uurreexxi, «Nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Isinna tenne hiyyeeshshanni anguwwa ifixxanna cinaachcha insa'ne'ni leellishe. Hordofeeyyetinna Gootta uudde wodda yo'oshsha gammadde. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Higgeenni Yessuusi insa'nee, «Nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal! Aabi anee ergemmashsha Aninna ha'noo ergannon» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Isinna tennee hiyyeechchi udma insa'ne'ni uffuu hiyyeexxi hiyyee qici, «Woyyichcha Hafuura adhdhee; <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />ha'no manniinxa cubbo gattowwaal hitinoole cubbo ha'noxxinna gattowwaal hiyyendaan; ha'no manniinxa cubbo gattowwaal hiyya gophphinoole kinni ha'no'a gattowwaal hiyyendabaan.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Toomaasi'n leelleexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ookkone wodda tommenna lamiinxe hordofeeyye giddii'ni mitti Didimoosi hiyyemeek Toomaasi, Yessuusi dagee wodda isi insa'nenni welti hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Tennexxee wele hordofeeyyenna iso'ni, «No'o Gootta uunde'eennen» hite. Yaane kinni isi insa'nee, «Ani misimaret otendeexxa isixxa anga uudebe'noki, qubichcho ankanna otememmaba uggebe'nok; anga anxanna otemeemmake cinaachcha'n ugge uudebe'nok Ani amanabe'no» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Torbati uduma hordofeeyye higgeenni mini giddo hexxemman: Toomaasinna ookko insa'nenni welti hedhemman. Huluwwa danqarendee hexxe'naa Yessuusi dageexxi insa'nexxe oddo'n uurre, «Nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi Toomaasii'i, «Qubichcho atika kaba uggi; anga anxanna uudi; anga atixxa diriirsite cinaachcha anke'n otemennaba uggi; amani malee mandoxxee» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toomaasinna, «Anke Goottaa, anke Magemoo!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusinna isoo, «Ati anee uuddee amandeetten. Uudebaak amanaakiir eebbiseme'eeken» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yessuusi konnee maxaafa'n borreessemebaaka wele heddo manbe'iinka beessisuwwa ifixxe hordofeeyye edo hujedheen. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Yaane kinni Yessuusi isi Kiristoosi Magenike Belto kadeexxa amandinaashsha, amandinnenna isike summinni hedho alfitinaashsha tinni borreessende'een.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yessuusi Torbaane Hordofeeyye'ni Leelleexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusi Xibiryadoosixxe abbaayya bira higgeenni ifixxe hordofeeyye'ni leelle; leellemma qicinna konneechchinn butti'a hedheen: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosi, Didimoosi hiyyemeek Toomaasi, Geliilake bogike Qaanake Naatina'eeli, Zebidewoosixxi labbaxxi oosenna hordofeeyye giddii'ni wele lame welti mitteba hexxemman. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna insa'ne, «Ani qulxu'me abixxonnaa me'aannen» hiyye: insa'nenna, «No'onna ati welti me'innano» hine. Insa'ne'na ke'ne me'ineexxi hobolote'ni e'yine: insa'nenna eettene hashsha'ni mittechchonna abindemmabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luq. 5:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Bogi soode wodda, Yessuusi abbaayyati qarqara uurre: yaane kinn hordofeeyye Yessuusite kadeexxa insa'ne egennemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Isinna insa'ne, «Tee oose, qulxu'me affinee?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Insa'nenna iso'n, «Anfeebe'non» hine. <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Isinna insa'nee, «Marabe ha'nooxxa hobolotibaa'ni middi darre'ni darbe qulxu'me alfitinaan» hiyye. Insa'nenna marebe darbineexxa yanna qulxu'metixxe bira sa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa marabe harkisa dandeennebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luq. 5:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yessuusii eeyyammak hordofisanji Pheexiroosi'n, «Goottakeqqa!» hiyye. Simi'ooni Pheexiroosinna, «Goottakeqqa» hiyyeeka hiyyichcho laqee wodda; isi fulchedheexxi butta uggemmaxxa fugatammaxxa seemma oddo'weexxi utaale abbaayya giddo e'ye. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Wele hordofeeyye kinni abbaayyati birii'ni lame dhibba ciqile calla bayyantemmaxxee, qulxu'me wo'miteexxa marabe insa'ne harkinsa'ni eettene hobolonni iyyedange.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Insa'nenna bagoba fullee wodda giiratike kashilo'n qulxu'metanna buddeena uunde. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yessuusinna insa'nee, «Ta'a abiddinemmaxxe qulxu'menaa'n iyyedagge» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Tennexxee Simi'ooni Pheexiroosi hoboloti giddi'a e'yeexxi marabe bagobaa harkise: marabe giddo mitte dhibbanna onde tommenna sase lumollamma qulxu'muwwa wo'miteemman: konne qicinni marabe wo'mitoolenna darendebaan. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yessuusi insa'nee «Amme itte» hiyye. Insa'nenna isi Gootta kadeexxa egenemmaxxee hordofeeyye giddii'ni, «Ati ayyete?» hiyye isoo qoratee haseeki hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yessuusi dageexxi buddeena aadheexxi insa'ne'a uwwe: quluxu'metanna insa'ne'a uwwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yoona Yessuusi rewotenaa'n ke'echchi uduma ifixxe hordofeeyye'n leella'naa tinni sakkaxxe yannan.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusiinna Pheexiroosii'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Insa'ne indeechchi uduma Yessuusi Simi'ooni Pheexiroosii'i, «Koo Yoonake belto Simooni! Insa'ne irra ati anee eetaate?» hiyye. Pheexiroosinna hiisseexxi, «Eeti, anke Goootta! Ani atee eeyyannexxa atinn egendeetten» hiyye. Yessuusinna hiisseexxi, «Beltanna anxa bobaasi!» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Langaxxanna Yessuusi «Koo Yoonake belto Simi'ooni, dhugaandinni ati anee eetaatte?» hiyye. Isinna, «Eeti, anke Gootta, ani atee eeyyaannexxa atinni egendeetten» hiyye. Yessuusinna, «Buruusa anka heqqi» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Sakkaxxa yanna isoo, «Koo Yoonake belto Simi'ooni, ati Anee eetaatte?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pheexiroosinna Sakkaxxa yanna Yessuusi isoo, «Ati anee eetaatte» isi hiyye qoremmaxxee, «Anke Gootta; ati duuchchiinxa egendeetten; Ani atee eeyyaannexxa atinna egendeetten.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yessuusinna isoo hiyyee qici, «Gedhebo anka allal. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ani dhugaate ate'n hiyyaannen; ati ka'ummumma hexxette wodda seemma ifi'aanni oddo'wite eetettebaa me'itaattan; yaane kinn ati cindatto wodda anga atixxa iimi'a farri assittaton; wele manjinna ate'n ka'lishe'naa me'atee eetaabexxobaa atee adhdhe me'aan.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yessuusi tenne hiyyeechchi Pheexiroosi hitta hexxeexxe reyonni Mageno ulfessaaxxa ege'nisho'aten. Ookkoneechchi uduma Pheexiroosii, «Anee hordofi!» hiyye.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuusiinna Ookkonee Wele Hordoffallo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pheexiroosi udumi'a wirri hiyye wodda Yessuusi eeyammak hordofalli duuka insa'nexxa me'aa'naa afe; kunni hordofall ookkone wodda hashshixxa ita insa'ne inda'naa Yessuusixxe qoma bira shikki hiyyeexxi, «Anke Gootta; atee sa'isse uwwa'neek ayyete?» hiyyeekemman. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Pheexiroosi isoo uudeexxa yanna, «Anke Gootta! Isinataa?» hiyye Yessuusii qore. <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yessuusinna hiisseexxi, «Ani daganno qico'n isi hedhoti hedhaashsha eeti uwwonnole midde atee maachcho giddo e'yishe? Ati umo atingeninni anee hordofi» hiyye. <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Tennena'ni kexxeexxa, Kunni hordofanji reyabaan hiyyedaaxxi odo dayyuwwiinxe oddo'ni laqende. Yaane kinni Yessuusi, «Ani daganno qico'n isi hedhoti hedhaashsha ani eetii uwwonnole atee maachcho atee giddo e'yishe?» hiyyee malee isi reyabaaxxa haaso'ebaan.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Tenne yaanuwwa dhugaa kuleekinna tennee borreesseeki konne hordofanjon: dhugaa kula isixxinna dhugaatixxe kaddeexxa no'o egeneennen. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yessuusi hujeexxi wele heddo yaanuwwa hexxeen: duuchchiinxa yaane mitte mitte sila borreessendeexxe kaddeele kinni borreessemeeka maxaafa butta duuchcha'n uginaaki boonchi hedhaachcho ane'n lababaani.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>